(308437, 23069, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, it gave me a laugh.</td>', 'Well, it gave me a laugh.', '2003-05-28 01:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(308439, 22621, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like that song :)  This is just such a NICE photo. The tones are great. I bet it''s gorgeous in fall too. Perfect exposure. You just need a little old model T or a little girl going down the road. The shadows on the road are cool... I just had to comment on this one because I''m already tired of voting on all these others, and I just started  *sigh*</td>', 'I like that song :)  This is just such a NICE photo. The tones are great. I bet it''s gorgeous in fall too. Perfect exposure. You just need a little old model T or a little girl going down the road. The shadows on the road are cool... I just had to comment on this one because I''m already tired of voting on all these others, and I just started  *sigh*', '2003-05-28 01:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(308441, 22621, 7242, '<td valign="top">Love it! Is it infrared?</td>', 'Love it! Is it infrared?', '2003-05-28 01:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(308442, 22958, 8129, '<td valign="top">Cuteness!  10</td>', 'Cuteness!  10', '2003-05-28 01:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(308443, 22396, 7969, '<td valign="top">Funny title.</td>', 'Funny title.', '2003-05-28 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(308444, 22877, 5534, '<td valign="top">That bright spot (caused by the flash?) is a bit distracting, other then that it''s ok.</td>', 'That bright spot (caused by the flash?) is a bit distracting, other then that it''s ok.', '2003-05-28 01:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(308445, 23066, 7033, '<td valign="top">I get what you were going for here and I do like your composition. It''s different. I guess I''m a bit boring, though and woiuld like to see more of that beautiful house instead of the street sign. Nice color and clarity. I wish the black car wasn''t there. Nice job on cropping, it fits well.</td>', 'I get what you were going for here and I do like your composition. It''s different. I guess I''m a bit boring, though and woiuld like to see more of that beautiful house instead of the street sign. Nice color and clarity. I wish the black car wasn''t there. Nice job on cropping, it fits well.', '2003-05-28 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(308449, 22884, 7033, '<td valign="top">It appears you have a nice compistion going on here. I do like the colors of the clothing on the pedestrians, that makes for an eye-grabbing shot. I do wish your photo was more in focus.</td>', 'It appears you have a nice compistion going on here. I do like the colors of the clothing on the pedestrians, that makes for an eye-grabbing shot. I do wish your photo was more in focus.', '2003-05-28 01:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(308450, 22622, 7969, '<td valign="top">Like the clouds, little dark,</td>', 'Like the clouds, little dark,', '2003-05-28 01:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(308451, 23067, 7033, '<td valign="top">This shot has a ton of potential. I would have cleaned up a bit and made the bed. If you had done that, this could have looked like something in a home decor magazine. I wish the lamp wasn''t on, that''s distracting. I do like your choice of subject and color.</td>', 'This shot has a ton of potential. I would have cleaned up a bit and made the bed. If you had done that, this could have looked like something in a home decor magazine. I wish the lamp wasn''t on, that''s distracting. I do like your choice of subject and color.', '2003-05-28 01:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(308453, 22935, 5534, '<td valign="top">Good photo...I like that''s it''s not a boring straight on shot of the house.</td>', 'Good photo...I like that''s it''s not a boring straight on shot of the house.', '2003-05-28 01:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(308457, 22512, 7033, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is one incredible picture. You''re so lucky to have such beautiful scenery. Congratulations on such an awesome photo. I do think it is a bit of a stretch for the challenge so I''m giving it a 9. I don''t think it''s completely off, it still counts, but it just doesn''t make me think of Home Sweet Home. Congrats again. This is wall worthy.</td>', 'WOW! This is one incredible picture. You''re so lucky to have such beautiful scenery. Congratulations on such an awesome photo. I do think it is a bit of a stretch for the challenge so I''m giving it a 9. I don''t think it''s completely off, it still counts, but it just doesn''t make me think of Home Sweet Home. Congrats again. This is wall worthy.', '2003-05-28 01:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(308459, 22868, 5534, '<td valign="top">Might just be me, but the sky looks a little dull, something in the air?  Nice shot of the city though.</td>', 'Might just be me, but the sky looks a little dull, something in the air?  Nice shot of the city though.', '2003-05-28 01:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(308460, 23077, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but home...?</td>', 'Great shot, but home...?', '2003-05-28 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(308461, 22615, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I love your color. There does seem to be a bit of something missing from this photo, maybe because it''s all about the same color, I''m not sure. Maybe an airplane or something. I don''t know. This really is a great photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice shot. I love your color. There does seem to be a bit of something missing from this photo, maybe because it''s all about the same color, I''m not sure. Maybe an airplane or something. I don''t know. This really is a great photo. Nice job.', '2003-05-28 01:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(308463, 23039, 7242, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous shot. Dreamy with beautiful lighting. 10</td>', 'This is a fabulous shot. Dreamy with beautiful lighting. 10', '2003-05-28 01:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(308467, 22982, 7969, '<td valign="top">Is he sticking his tongue out at me??  Great title.</td>', 'Is he sticking his tongue out at me??  Great title.', '2003-05-28 01:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(308469, 22987, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting compostion. I think your flowers make an incredible and beautiful foreground. I do like the bowls and I would have lost the green bottle of whatever. I wish I could see the stove a little clearer and a little more of expression from your husband/dad. I''m guessing husband since most people don''t find their dad an interesting enough specimen to photograph. :) The window glare is a bit distracting. I think the table, flowers and bowls would have made a glorious shot all on their own. Nice job on capturing the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting compostion. I think your flowers make an incredible and beautiful foreground. I do like the bowls and I would have lost the green bottle of whatever. I wish I could see the stove a little clearer and a little more of expression from your husband/dad. I''m guessing husband since most people don''t find their dad an interesting enough specimen to photograph. :) The window glare is a bit distracting. I think the table, flowers and bowls would have made a glorious shot all on their own. Nice job on capturing the challenge.', '2003-05-28 01:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(308470, 22942, 5534, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2003-05-28 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(308471, 23031, 8732, '<td valign="top">Very good, but I think you included a little too much sky at the top - don''t crop it all off, but a bit less. 8.</td>', 'Very good, but I think you included a little too much sky at the top - don''t crop it all off, but a bit less. 8.', '2003-05-28 01:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(308475, 22946, 6870, '<td valign="top">Coming upon this photo, it really does remind me of older color photographs of the 50s! Good capture of expression. It really does say "home" to me.</td>', 'Coming upon this photo, it really does remind me of older color photographs of the 50s! Good capture of expression. It really does say "home" to me.', '2003-05-28 01:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(308478, 22373, 1143, '<td valign="top">I still think that''s an awesome photo, but taking a pic of it just isn''t quite the same - especially with the glare on the glass.</td>', 'I still think that''s an awesome photo, but taking a pic of it just isn''t quite the same - especially with the glare on the glass.', '2003-05-28 02:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(308479, 22907, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a much more meticulous street person than I am.  LOL<br/></td>', 'This is a much more meticulous street person than I am.  LOL', '2003-05-28 02:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(308480, 23016, 7033, '<td valign="top">Wow. I do see how much time you spent putting together your compositon. Your photo is incredibly colorful and sharpness is perfect. My one criticism is that your stargazer lily is distracting. I think the photo is too busy with it. I would have either taken it out, and taken out the jar of strawverry hame. I would have not cropped the top so short (I want to see more of that beautiful yard to get more of a feel of your home). Nice job, though, I do like it.</td>', 'Wow. I do see how much time you spent putting together your compositon. Your photo is incredibly colorful and sharpness is perfect. My one criticism is that your stargazer lily is distracting. I think the photo is too busy with it. I would have either taken it out, and taken out the jar of strawverry hame. I would have not cropped the top so short (I want to see more of that beautiful yard to get more of a feel of your home). Nice job, though, I do like it.', '2003-05-28 02:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(308481, 22980, 7242, '<td valign="top">Stellar! 10</td>', 'Stellar! 10', '2003-05-28 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(308484, 23052, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the tree. Your pic seems to be leaning a bit (or is it the house? :) It seems a little over saturated in the leaves (or is it softenend) Not sure. Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'Nice composition with the tree. Your pic seems to be leaning a bit (or is it the house? :) It seems a little over saturated in the leaves (or is it softenend) Not sure. Nice choice of subject.', '2003-05-28 02:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(308487, 23077, 1143, '<td valign="top">great shot! too bad it doesn''t fit the challenge as well as some others . great dof and focus</td>', 'great shot! too bad it doesn''t fit the challenge as well as some others . great dof and focus', '2003-05-28 02:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(308488, 22888, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting spin on the challenge. Definitely original. I do think your border is unnecessary and I would have left the hand out of the pic. Maybe you could have made your subject off center to draw our eyes to one side of the photograph. Nice clarity in photo.</td>', 'Interesting spin on the challenge. Definitely original. I do think your border is unnecessary and I would have left the hand out of the pic. Maybe you could have made your subject off center to draw our eyes to one side of the photograph. Nice clarity in photo.', '2003-05-28 02:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(308489, 22501, 7969, '<td valign="top">Lucky you!</td>', 'Lucky you!', '2003-05-28 02:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(308490, 22740, 7033, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I just can''t decide whether I like your little circle or not. I like your color and choice of subject. I wish I knew where the circle was coming from and I would probably "get it" a little better. Nice job.</td>', 'Hmmm. I just can''t decide whether I like your little circle or not. I like your color and choice of subject. I wish I knew where the circle was coming from and I would probably "get it" a little better. Nice job.', '2003-05-28 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(308491, 22293, 7969, '<td valign="top">Perspective is well done.</td>', 'Perspective is well done.', '2003-05-28 02:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(308492, 22502, 7033, '<td valign="top">The gnarled tree on the right is the most interesting part of the photo, I would have placed this photo a bit more to the right and cropped off a bit of the bottom. Congrats on finding something so interesting to photograph.</td>', 'The gnarled tree on the right is the most interesting part of the photo, I would have placed this photo a bit more to the right and cropped off a bit of the bottom. Congrats on finding something so interesting to photograph.', '2003-05-28 02:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(308493, 22717, 7033, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool. I wish there wasn''t a reflection in the glass. And I hope you can close the backside when you''re in the bathtub!</td>', 'That''s pretty cool. I wish there wasn''t a reflection in the glass. And I hope you can close the backside when you''re in the bathtub!', '2003-05-28 02:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(308495, 22385, 7033, '<td valign="top">Seven....Hmmmm....seven....I suddenly feel my IQ dropping, I don''t know what you mean by seven. The landscaping is nice. I would have caught this from the side a little more, personally, so as to detract from the tree shadows in the windows. Nice job, though. seven.....</td>', 'Seven....Hmmmm....seven....I suddenly feel my IQ dropping, I don''t know what you mean by seven. The landscaping is nice. I would have caught this from the side a little more, personally, so as to detract from the tree shadows in the windows. Nice job, though. seven.....', '2003-05-28 02:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(308496, 23074, 7969, '<td valign="top">Technically very good, nice colors, boat works well in it.</td>', 'Technically very good, nice colors, boat works well in it.', '2003-05-28 02:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(308498, 23060, 7033, '<td valign="top">You used to live next to a fence? Just kidding. I like your choice of black and white but have to wonder what it looked like in color. That bush back there looks like it could be beautiful. You leave me wondering about the rest of the house...</td>', 'You used to live next to a fence? Just kidding. I like your choice of black and white but have to wonder what it looked like in color. That bush back there looks like it could be beautiful. You leave me wondering about the rest of the house...', '2003-05-28 02:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(308500, 22406, 7033, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly, I think this photo works. Your color is nice and the texture you captured on the back wall is neat. I like the plant in the right. I am not sure about the thing on the wall on the left and the photo. They are both distracting. I love the flower pot thingy and the candelabra. Nice job.</td>', 'Surprisingly, I think this photo works. Your color is nice and the texture you captured on the back wall is neat. I like the plant in the right. I am not sure about the thing on the wall on the left and the photo. They are both distracting. I love the flower pot thingy and the candelabra. Nice job.', '2003-05-28 02:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(308501, 22512, 7969, '<td valign="top">Would have  given you another point or two if was postcard or nature challenge.</td>', 'Would have  given you another point or two if was postcard or nature challenge.', '2003-05-28 02:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(308502, 23015, 7033, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch on the challenge but you did manage to capture some beautiful blossoms. This photo could use a frame ( I almost never say that but in this cirumstance it really could) I would have used a black and cream double grame.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch on the challenge but you did manage to capture some beautiful blossoms. This photo could use a frame ( I almost never say that but in this cirumstance it really could) I would have used a black and cream double grame.', '2003-05-28 02:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(308504, 22341, 7033, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this is cool. I love how you framed this. It is so inspiring. This is wall worthy photography. Congratulations - 10</td>', 'Whoa, this is cool. I love how you framed this. It is so inspiring. This is wall worthy photography. Congratulations - 10', '2003-05-28 02:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(308505, 22452, 4767, '<td valign="top">je me souviens....</td>', 'je me souviens....', '2003-05-28 02:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(308507, 22986, 7033, '<td valign="top">The transportation challenge was a couple of weeks ago. I do like your photo, though you are stretching the challenge a bit. Nice composition and texture.</td>', 'The transportation challenge was a couple of weeks ago. I do like your photo, though you are stretching the challenge a bit. Nice composition and texture.', '2003-05-28 02:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(308508, 22255, 7033, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white. This photo just does not make me think of home, however. And it does seem like the pic is a bit OOF.</td>', 'I like the black and white. This photo just does not make me think of home, however. And it does seem like the pic is a bit OOF.', '2003-05-28 02:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(308509, 22857, 7242, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and charming. Nice interpretation of home.</td>', 'Beautiful and charming. Nice interpretation of home.', '2003-05-28 02:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(308510, 22946, 7033, '<td valign="top">GREAT capture of emotion. This would have made such a beautiful black and white. I would have cropped the top either a little higher or a little lower. Cute family ya got there.</td>', 'GREAT capture of emotion. This would have made such a beautiful black and white. I would have cropped the top either a little higher or a little lower. Cute family ya got there.', '2003-05-28 02:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(308513, 23057, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like what you did here. I do wish the back wall had a little more color to add something to the photo. Maybe you should have put these pictures against a feltboard or something. Nice photography in the pic.</td>', 'Interesting. I like what you did here. I do wish the back wall had a little more color to add something to the photo. Maybe you should have put these pictures against a feltboard or something. Nice photography in the pic.', '2003-05-28 02:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(308514, 23070, 5925, '<td valign="top">Is this really your home?  hehe just joshin.  <br/>The light coming through the barn slats really sets this picture''s tone of ''an old barn''.  End of the day... end of the barn''s life.  I like.  However, it seems to be just a little too dark.  I know it''s supposed to be sunset but still. 8</td>', 'Is this really your home?  hehe just joshin.  The light coming through the barn slats really sets this picture''s tone of ''an old barn''.  End of the day... end of the barn''s life.  I like.  However, it seems to be just a little too dark.  I know it''s supposed to be sunset but still. 8', '2003-05-28 02:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(308515, 22289, 7033, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I don''t really get Home Sweet Home out of this. And what is that green light? A naked light bulb just doesn''t make an interesting photo, to be honest. Maybe off center it a little and either add some interesting shadow casts or something else al together.</td>', 'Hmmm. I don''t really get Home Sweet Home out of this. And what is that green light? A naked light bulb just doesn''t make an interesting photo, to be honest. Maybe off center it a little and either add some interesting shadow casts or something else al together.', '2003-05-28 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(308516, 23005, 7033, '<td valign="top">Creative title. I do wish these flowers were in the pic a little more. They are so beuatiful and crisp. Nice job, though. -8</td>', 'Creative title. I do wish these flowers were in the pic a little more. They are so beuatiful and crisp. Nice job, though. -8', '2003-05-28 02:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
