(309050, 22948, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and I really like th eway you cropped this. I would have cut off 1/8 on the left. You have me wondering where this is. Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice subject and I really like th eway you cropped this. I would have cut off 1/8 on the left. You have me wondering where this is. Nice photo.', '2003-05-28 13:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
