(309332, 23031, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... first impression is this is too boring.  But then that becomes its draw.... I like what the square crop does for the image. The roof of the barn points up at that empty sky. Just wish that the patch of green grass was completely contained within the frame. Also, nice colors... green and yellow, and alternating shades of gray in the from the ligtest in the sky, alternating shades in the  barn, and that light patch of sticks next to the darker mud.... NEATO!  8</td>', 'Hmmmm... first impression is this is too boring.  But then that becomes its draw.... I like what the square crop does for the image. The roof of the barn points up at that empty sky. Just wish that the patch of green grass was completely contained within the frame. Also, nice colors... green and yellow, and alternating shades of gray in the from the ligtest in the sky, alternating shades in the  barn, and that light patch of sticks next to the darker mud.... NEATO!  8', '2003-05-28 15:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(309335, 22929, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting pieces, but the color saturation seems overly heavy.   Strong color, but it overpowers the elements of the photo.  The set up doesn''t seem condusive to the elements, too (too random).  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting pieces, but the color saturation seems overly heavy.   Strong color, but it overpowers the elements of the photo.  The set up doesn''t seem condusive to the elements, too (too random).  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-28 15:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(309336, 22497, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmph.... this is somewhat arresting...</td>', 'Hmmph.... this is somewhat arresting...', '2003-05-28 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(309339, 22621, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this!  amazing perspective!  i love how the road disappears into the branch overhang...makes me wonder what lies beyond.  nice soft feel while keeping the detail and textures.  good job!</td>', 'i love this!  amazing perspective!  i love how the road disappears into the branch overhang...makes me wonder what lies beyond.  nice soft feel while keeping the detail and textures.  good job!', '2003-05-28 15:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(309340, 23007, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting motion effect, but very difficult viewing.  I''ll take your word for it (see title), but from what I see, it looks more like a cigarette being put out in an ashtray.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting motion effect, but very difficult viewing.  I''ll take your word for it (see title), but from what I see, it looks more like a cigarette being put out in an ashtray.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-28 15:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
