(309351, 22877, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot.  The glare on the wall is a bit nasty.  Nice painting, whose art is it?  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot.  The glare on the wall is a bit nasty.  Nice painting, whose art is it?  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-28 15:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309355, 22404, 7653, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, and the title is well chosen too. Helps get me in the mood to properly digest and appreciate the shot. Window with the blinds looks somehow crooked, which is a slight distraction. I dont know about your monitor but the plant on the right is baaaaaarely discernable. I''d like just a hair more light on it. Good work though.</td>', 'I like this shot, and the title is well chosen too. Helps get me in the mood to properly digest and appreciate the shot. Window with the blinds looks somehow crooked, which is a slight distraction. I dont know about your monitor but the plant on the right is baaaaaarely discernable. I''d like just a hair more light on it. Good work though.', '2003-05-28 15:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309357, 22836, 8066, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2003-05-28 15:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(309362, 23039, 6565, '<td valign="top">The image is not very crisp, but that adds to the dreamy quality.  I like this a lot!</td>', 'The image is not very crisp, but that adds to the dreamy quality.  I like this a lot!', '2003-05-28 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(309363, 22621, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very formal, seen it done before, but I like the way that this picture comes across.  The road sign actually helps, because it reminds you that this is a road TO somewhere, which is important for the "home sweet home" theme.</td>', 'Very formal, seen it done before, but I like the way that this picture comes across.  The road sign actually helps, because it reminds you that this is a road TO somewhere, which is important for the "home sweet home" theme.', '2003-05-28 15:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(309365, 22926, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very original interpretation!  The layout is a bit formal, would have liked to have seen it on an angle, maybe, but I like the concept a lot!</td>', 'Very original interpretation!  The layout is a bit formal, would have liked to have seen it on an angle, maybe, but I like the concept a lot!', '2003-05-28 15:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(309370, 22303, 6565, '<td valign="top">I''d have pumped up the contrast a bit on this to make it stand out more.  (Of all the "road sign" photos, I like this one the best) :)</td>', 'I''d have pumped up the contrast a bit on this to make it stand out more.  (Of all the "road sign" photos, I like this one the best) :)', '2003-05-28 15:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
