(309376, 23040, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the originality of this, and the vividness.  I could tell it was a bedframe from the thumbnail, without knowing the title.  Meets the challenge in an interesting way!</td>', 'I like the originality of this, and the vividness.  I could tell it was a bedframe from the thumbnail, without knowing the title.  Meets the challenge in an interesting way!', '2003-05-28 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
