(309522, 22919, 8472, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space, it really gives the illusion that your lawn is immense. It looks a bit skewed to the right, and the bright white awning is calling a lot of attention to itself. It may have been a better photo if that one wasnt there.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space, it really gives the illusion that your lawn is immense. It looks a bit skewed to the right, and the bright white awning is calling a lot of attention to itself. It may have been a better photo if that one wasnt there.', '2003-05-28 18:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
