(309525, 22847, 8472, '<td valign="top">A nice balance in the photo, however slightly left heavy. The baloon in the distance is perfectly framed in the sky thats showing.</td>', 'A nice balance in the photo, however slightly left heavy. The baloon in the distance is perfectly framed in the sky thats showing.', '2003-05-28 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
