(309732, 22857, 6504, '<td valign="top">That''s a terrific picture!!   I love the sepia tone which gives it the old fashioned look.    I personally love sheets dried on the line.  I give this a 9</td>', 'That''s a terrific picture!!   I love the sepia tone which gives it the old fashioned look.    I personally love sheets dried on the line.  I give this a 9', '2003-05-28 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(309733, 22341, 6504, '<td valign="top">How nice this is.  I would like to see part of the house in the picture.</td>', 'How nice this is.  I would like to see part of the house in the picture.', '2003-05-28 22:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(309734, 22508, 8178, '<td valign="top">That''s very cute! The dog seems a bit out of focus because he was moving.</td>', 'That''s very cute! The dog seems a bit out of focus because he was moving.', '2003-05-28 22:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(309736, 22957, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!   What a great shot of these cats.  The color, tone, lighting, composition, you have it all.</td>', 'Beautiful!   What a great shot of these cats.  The color, tone, lighting, composition, you have it all.', '2003-05-28 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(309737, 22659, 6504, '<td valign="top">Everything is a little blurry.   A tripod would really help in a shot like this.</td>', 'Everything is a little blurry.   A tripod would really help in a shot like this.', '2003-05-28 22:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(309738, 23059, 7885, '<td valign="top">Apparently worker ants are basically automatons controlled chemically by the colony, so whether they have a concept of home sweet home life that could meet the challenge focus is a point of doubt. The shot does demonstrate keen powers of observation, however, with pleasant pastel pink and green hues free from oversaturation.</td>', 'Apparently worker ants are basically automatons controlled chemically by the colony, so whether they have a concept of home sweet home life that could meet the challenge focus is a point of doubt. The shot does demonstrate keen powers of observation, however, with pleasant pastel pink and green hues free from oversaturation.', '2003-05-28 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(309739, 22508, 6504, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp picture, good colors, great shot of Cosby.  He looks ferocious!<br/>Good all the way around.  I think it''s the winner.  10</td>', 'Nice sharp picture, good colors, great shot of Cosby.  He looks ferocious!Good all the way around.  I think it''s the winner.  10', '2003-05-28 22:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(309740, 23025, 6504, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect.  Beautiful picture.  Do you really live here?</td>', 'Absolutely perfect.  Beautiful picture.  Do you really live here?', '2003-05-28 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(309741, 22880, 6504, '<td valign="top">What a very nice picture.  The clothes on the line adds a very homey feeling.<br/>Looks like a place I would like to live.   10 from me.</td>', 'What a very nice picture.  The clothes on the line adds a very homey feeling.Looks like a place I would like to live.   10 from me.', '2003-05-28 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(309742, 22998, 8178, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I like the expensive shoes in the background. But where is your home?</td>', 'Excellent shot! I like the expensive shoes in the background. But where is your home?', '2003-05-28 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(309744, 23031, 7885, '<td valign="top">I think more subtle colours would work well here. Nice drop shadow border.</td>', 'I think more subtle colours would work well here. Nice drop shadow border.', '2003-05-28 22:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(309746, 23000, 7778, '<td valign="top">Left to right: Tiles: spotless - no esthetic ''tour-de-force''; fixtures - functional Americana; leg - a male''s, caucasion between 18 and 35; beer - domestic, but bottled, suggestive of a cultured pedestrianism; hands and manicure - neither a pianist''s nor a coachman''s; curtain - ornate fabricated lace imitation reminiscent of sea creatures in accesory style.<br/> <br/>The lighting in this shot is superb and appropiate like everything else. The curtan alone, with the light on it, provides a repose from the sanitary bathroom idyll. :-)</td>', 'Left to right: Tiles: spotless - no esthetic ''tour-de-force''; fixtures - functional Americana; leg - a male''s, caucasion between 18 and 35; beer - domestic, but bottled, suggestive of a cultured pedestrianism; hands and manicure - neither a pianist''s nor a coachman''s; curtain - ornate fabricated lace imitation reminiscent of sea creatures in accesory style. The lighting in this shot is superb and appropiate like everything else. The curtan alone, with the light on it, provides a repose from the sanitary bathroom idyll. :-)', '2003-05-28 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(309749, 22481, 7778, '<td valign="top">Blow up the offensive houseboat and you''ve got a potential shot!<br/>Grossly overprocessed! An insult to nature and the senses.</td>', 'Blow up the offensive houseboat and you''ve got a potential shot!Grossly overprocessed! An insult to nature and the senses.', '2003-05-28 22:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(309750, 23015, 6597, '<td valign="top">I love lilacs and you''ve done such a good job the white and the green make a good combination                        8</td>', 'I love lilacs and you''ve done such a good job the white and the green make a good combination                        8', '2003-05-28 22:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(309751, 22992, 7778, '<td valign="top">Actually, a wonderful capture lacking a topical credibility likely required by most voters in the challenge... &gt; 6</td>', 'Actually, a wonderful capture lacking a topical credibility likely required by most voters in the challenge... > 6', '2003-05-28 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(309753, 22991, 6597, '<td valign="top">looks like a home</td>', 'looks like a home', '2003-05-28 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(309756, 22968, 7885, '<td valign="top">Nice solarisation effect and border combination. It almost looks like a drawing.</td>', 'Nice solarisation effect and border combination. It almost looks like a drawing.', '2003-05-28 22:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(309760, 22998, 7758, '<td valign="top">good image, but I think you might have back focused on the shoes......</td>', 'good image, but I think you might have back focused on the shoes......', '2003-05-28 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(309765, 23077, 7778, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, no doubt deserving a higher rating than it will get here under this (specific) topic. It just does Not say ''Home Sweet Home''. But does it ever break up the monotony of voting on shots of street signs, street signs, street signs!</td>', 'Beautiful capture, no doubt deserving a higher rating than it will get here under this (specific) topic. It just does Not say ''Home Sweet Home''. But does it ever break up the monotony of voting on shots of street signs, street signs, street signs!', '2003-05-28 23:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(309767, 22404, 772, '<td valign="top">Your title sums up why I think this is a great photo... my favorite of the challenge.. = 10</td>', 'Your title sums up why I think this is a great photo... my favorite of the challenge.. = 10', '2003-05-28 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309772, 22861, 7778, '<td valign="top">Nice back of a rose, Harley looks like a sensitive guy (depite the name), the trailer and vehicles add nothing to rosy and Harley, the sparse foreground grass is not the prettiest sight, the sky, being washed, bears no interest. A shallow depth of field would remedy most of these shortcomings and make for a better picture, IMO.</td>', 'Nice back of a rose, Harley looks like a sensitive guy (depite the name), the trailer and vehicles add nothing to rosy and Harley, the sparse foreground grass is not the prettiest sight, the sky, being washed, bears no interest. A shallow depth of field would remedy most of these shortcomings and make for a better picture, IMO.', '2003-05-28 23:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(309773, 22634, 6803, '<td valign="top">nice landscape!:)</td>', 'nice landscape!:)', '2003-05-28 23:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(309774, 22615, 6803, '<td valign="top">nice work!</td>', 'nice work!', '2003-05-28 23:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(309784, 22801, 7743, '<td valign="top">To emphasize the vacant area in the sky I would have spot metered on the sky so it wasn''t so washed out.    I would also show more of the sky.    It probably would have been better if you were in a crosswalk taking the picture rather than your car.  Though I''m sure the drivers behind you wouldn''t have appreciated you getting out to take a picture.  I like the slight tilt.  It adds impact.  The focus is a little soft.  I think the focus should have been on the buildings at the very back of the picture.  This, along with more sky and better exposure would draw the viewer in to your picture.</td>', 'To emphasize the vacant area in the sky I would have spot metered on the sky so it wasn''t so washed out.    I would also show more of the sky.    It probably would have been better if you were in a crosswalk taking the picture rather than your car.  Though I''m sure the drivers behind you wouldn''t have appreciated you getting out to take a picture.  I like the slight tilt.  It adds impact.  The focus is a little soft.  I think the focus should have been on the buildings at the very back of the picture.  This, along with more sky and better exposure would draw the viewer in to your picture.', '2003-05-29 00:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(309794, 22957, 4388, '<td valign="top">this would be a good candidate for a square picture</td>', 'this would be a good candidate for a square picture', '2003-05-29 00:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(309795, 22848, 7778, '<td valign="top">May I suggest I syntactically correct title: "A Repair Joint Cyclists'' WheelsCall Home". Still, a complex title...<br/> <br/>The light, except for the flashlight near the wheel, is too unnaturally red. Otherwise, this could be a reasonable study, given the attention of the onlookers.</td>', 'May I suggest I syntactically correct title: "A Repair Joint Cyclists'' WheelsCall Home". Still, a complex title... The light, except for the flashlight near the wheel, is too unnaturally red. Otherwise, this could be a reasonable study, given the attention of the onlookers.', '2003-05-29 00:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(309798, 23048, 7778, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to decide what, if anything, is alluded to with the latent meaning of the title. Would it be irony or sarcasm regarding the suburban baroque of the artifacts?</td>', 'I''m trying to decide what, if anything, is alluded to with the latent meaning of the title. Would it be irony or sarcasm regarding the suburban baroque of the artifacts?', '2003-05-29 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(309808, 22616, 7778, '<td valign="top">&gt; 10</td>', '> 10', '2003-05-29 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(309811, 22789, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing composition, and I like your rich colors.  However, in my opinion, I find the ragged border a bit distracting, taking away some of the impact you have captured elsewhere.</td>', 'Very pleasing composition, and I like your rich colors.  However, in my opinion, I find the ragged border a bit distracting, taking away some of the impact you have captured elsewhere.', '2003-05-29 01:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(309814, 22857, 5318, '<td valign="top">I love this picture   great shot</td>', 'I love this picture   great shot', '2003-05-29 01:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(309824, 22961, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice approach to the challenge.  I especially like the texture you have captured in the nest.  Unfortunately, several of the leaves are a bit too overexposed, in my opinion-- perhaps you could meter the shot differently?</td>', 'Very nice approach to the challenge.  I especially like the texture you have captured in the nest.  Unfortunately, several of the leaves are a bit too overexposed, in my opinion-- perhaps you could meter the shot differently?', '2003-05-29 01:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(309826, 22821, 7033, '<td valign="top">Love the rich, saturated color and creative approach to the challenge!  I''m not sure I''m in love with the angle you shot this at, but it definitely creates an interesting shot.  --8</td>', 'Love the rich, saturated color and creative approach to the challenge!  I''m not sure I''m in love with the angle you shot this at, but it definitely creates an interesting shot.  --8', '2003-05-29 01:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(309831, 23060, 8056, '<td valign="top">I like the "dirty feel" of this pic,bring me the memory of watching the cowboy movie<br/>^ ^ nice shoot !! 5</td>', 'I like the "dirty feel" of this pic,bring me the memory of watching the cowboy movie^ ^ nice shoot !! 5', '2003-05-29 01:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(309832, 22946, 7778, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the intimate sincerity inherent in this capture. The natural expressions and gestures are matched by the lighting, which appears to be daylight. The wonderful couch cover relates a traditional element, the clean, unpretentiousdenim suggests hands-on work, provisions, safety. The frivolous dress of the girl on the left introduces joy and lightens the mood. One obvious flaw is the light area behind the top back of the couch, which, of course, cannot just be ''cropped off''. I would, ideally, also be able to see a lil more of the man''s sweater, for texture. <br/> <br/>All in all, this remains my favourite photograph in the challenge, and not alone for its topicality. This photo has ''range'', and I am moved by it. &gt; 8</td>', 'I enjoy the intimate sincerity inherent in this capture. The natural expressions and gestures are matched by the lighting, which appears to be daylight. The wonderful couch cover relates a traditional element, the clean, unpretentiousdenim suggests hands-on work, provisions, safety. The frivolous dress of the girl on the left introduces joy and lightens the mood. One obvious flaw is the light area behind the top back of the couch, which, of course, cannot just be ''cropped off''. I would, ideally, also be able to see a lil more of the man''s sweater, for texture.  All in all, this remains my favourite photograph in the challenge, and not alone for its topicality. This photo has ''range'', and I am moved by it. > 8', '2003-05-29 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(309836, 23028, 7570, '<td valign="top">oh, this must be the submission from a bee or insect that lives in flowers.</td>', 'oh, this must be the submission from a bee or insect that lives in flowers.', '2003-05-29 02:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
