(310344, 23066, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to move slightly to the right and take the picture, so the sign post is a little more to the left relative to the house - it would fill up some of that negative space in the sky that isn''t adding to the shot.  As it is, 7.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to move slightly to the right and take the picture, so the sign post is a little more to the left relative to the house - it would fill up some of that negative space in the sky that isn''t adding to the shot.  As it is, 7.', '2003-05-29 16:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
