(310384, 22875, 8488, '<td valign="top">5. Fits the theme well enough, and there are no blatant ''you suck!'' flaws to it, but neither does it really grab me for any reason at all. For reasons of composition, cropping, or subject choice, it''s just a photo, and doesn''t do especially much for me, aesthetically.</td>', '5. Fits the theme well enough, and there are no blatant ''you suck!'' flaws to it, but neither does it really grab me for any reason at all. For reasons of composition, cropping, or subject choice, it''s just a photo, and doesn''t do especially much for me, aesthetically.', '2003-05-29 17:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(310385, 22848, 8488, '<td valign="top">5. Fits the theme well enough, and there are no blatant ''you suck!'' flaws to it, but neither does it really grab me for any reason at all. For reasons of composition, cropping, or subject choice, it''s just a photo, and doesn''t do especially much for me, aesthetically.<br/> <br/>The deeply-saturated color everywhere but in the flashlight beam makes the rest of the image recede, blending into itself muddily, and what''s framed in the white light isn''t compositionally coherent. Maybe a little more post-camera tweaking to adjust the color/contrast might have made it pop more.</td>', '5. Fits the theme well enough, and there are no blatant ''you suck!'' flaws to it, but neither does it really grab me for any reason at all. For reasons of composition, cropping, or subject choice, it''s just a photo, and doesn''t do especially much for me, aesthetically. The deeply-saturated color everywhere but in the flashlight beam makes the rest of the image recede, blending into itself muddily, and what''s framed in the white light isn''t compositionally coherent. Maybe a little more post-camera tweaking to adjust the color/contrast might have made it pop more.', '2003-05-29 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(310386, 23073, 8488, '<td valign="top">5. Fits the theme well enough, and there are no blatant ''you suck!'' flaws to it, but neither does it really grab me for any reason at all. For reasons of composition, cropping, or subject choice, it''s just a photo, and doesn''t do especially much for me, aesthetically.<br/> <br/>A disembodied, lit section of the inside of a cube seems to hang in space strangely, with nothing to look at inside it.</td>', '5. Fits the theme well enough, and there are no blatant ''you suck!'' flaws to it, but neither does it really grab me for any reason at all. For reasons of composition, cropping, or subject choice, it''s just a photo, and doesn''t do especially much for me, aesthetically. A disembodied, lit section of the inside of a cube seems to hang in space strangely, with nothing to look at inside it.', '2003-05-29 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
