(310671, 23003, 4767, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the shirt!  I want to travel with THIS person next time I  go on vacation.  THEN, the people will point at HIS shirt, noy mine!  ;)</td>', 'I LOVE the shirt!  I want to travel with THIS person next time I  go on vacation.  THEN, the people will point at HIS shirt, noy mine!  ;)', '2003-05-30 01:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(310672, 23071, 4767, '<td valign="top">in days of yore from Britain''s shore,  Wolfe the dauntless hero came and planted firm Britannia''s flag on Canada''s fair domain.  Here may it wave, our boast, our pride, and join in love forever the thistle, shamrock, rose entwined, the Maple Leaf forever.  (Is the answer Ottawa?)  God save our queen and heaven bless the Maple Leaf Forever.</td>', 'in days of yore from Britain''s shore,  Wolfe the dauntless hero came and planted firm Britannia''s flag on Canada''s fair domain.  Here may it wave, our boast, our pride, and join in love forever the thistle, shamrock, rose entwined, the Maple Leaf forever.  (Is the answer Ottawa?)  God save our queen and heaven bless the Maple Leaf Forever.', '2003-05-30 02:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(310677, 22991, 7033, '<td valign="top">I would try coming at this from a hgher location, play with lighting and crop it a bit more so you are not trying to capture so mcuh. It''s too busy to make sense.</td>', 'I would try coming at this from a hgher location, play with lighting and crop it a bit more so you are not trying to capture so mcuh. It''s too busy to make sense.', '2003-05-30 02:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(310678, 23071, 7033, '<td valign="top">I suddenly feel very uneducated. Umm...London? That''s my only guess. I really like your flame thing but you have got me wondering why it''s there. Nice composition and warm tones.</td>', 'I suddenly feel very uneducated. Umm...London? That''s my only guess. I really like your flame thing but you have got me wondering why it''s there. Nice composition and warm tones.', '2003-05-30 02:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(310679, 22993, 7033, '<td valign="top">Cute title. I like how you captured the garbage, somehow that doesn''t distract even though it''s kind of clutterred. I wish I could see the bird''s eye and a little less light on the white cartons.</td>', 'Cute title. I like how you captured the garbage, somehow that doesn''t distract even though it''s kind of clutterred. I wish I could see the bird''s eye and a little less light on the white cartons.', '2003-05-30 02:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(310680, 22774, 7033, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting (overhsarpened maybe-I really can''t tell) I like your composition. I maybe would have cropped a bit more from the bottom. Nice color.</td>', 'Looks like a painting (overhsarpened maybe-I really can''t tell) I like your composition. I maybe would have cropped a bit more from the bottom. Nice color.', '2003-05-30 02:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(310681, 22995, 7033, '<td valign="top">Border clashes with photo. (teal and bright green don''t look good together) Pic is a bit busy. And I wish I could see someone''s emotion. Nice play on the challenge.</td>', 'Border clashes with photo. (teal and bright green don''t look good together) Pic is a bit busy. And I wish I could see someone''s emotion. Nice play on the challenge.', '2003-05-30 02:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(310682, 22849, 7033, '<td valign="top">Are we dorothy mayhaps? Nice background, I can tell you spent a lot of time on this. I really like your realistic placement of the toy horses and your child peering through is cute. I do wish I could see whether it''s a boy or a girl, the fact that it''s just eyes is kind of distracting.</td>', 'Are we dorothy mayhaps? Nice background, I can tell you spent a lot of time on this. I really like your realistic placement of the toy horses and your child peering through is cute. I do wish I could see whether it''s a boy or a girl, the fact that it''s just eyes is kind of distracting.', '2003-05-30 02:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(310684, 22939, 7033, '<td valign="top">I really love your perspective on this. Very original, and yet undisputably fits the challenge. I love the tones you''ve capture on the treesd. I do wish the building lights weren''t so bright, I want to know where we wish to belong.</td>', 'I really love your perspective on this. Very original, and yet undisputably fits the challenge. I love the tones you''ve capture on the treesd. I do wish the building lights weren''t so bright, I want to know where we wish to belong.', '2003-05-30 02:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(310685, 22968, 7033, '<td valign="top">Too oversatured for my taste. I like your colors and the border. And your composition is very nice. I just wiish it were clearer.</td>', 'Too oversatured for my taste. I like your colors and the border. And your composition is very nice. I just wiish it were clearer.', '2003-05-30 02:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(310686, 22653, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great quality and capture. Nice color. I just wish the bottom wasn''t cropped off, I kind of want to see it, but a nice composition nonetheless.</td>', 'Great quality and capture. Nice color. I just wish the bottom wasn''t cropped off, I kind of want to see it, but a nice composition nonetheless.', '2003-05-30 02:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(310705, 23011, 8682, '<td valign="top">wow... great...10</td>', 'wow... great...10', '2003-05-30 04:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(310714, 23019, 8682, '<td valign="top">great colours,... beatiful</td>', 'great colours,... beatiful', '2003-05-30 06:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(310744, 22880, 8130, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo, the subject and the composition.  But, there''s something about the focus that makes me strain to view it.</td>', 'I really love this photo, the subject and the composition.  But, there''s something about the focus that makes me strain to view it.', '2003-05-30 08:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(310751, 22986, 8130, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  If the straps on the upper left and the numbers below the chrome had been cropped I would have liked it even better.</td>', 'Great photo.  If the straps on the upper left and the numbers below the chrome had been cropped I would have liked it even better.', '2003-05-30 09:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(310756, 23025, 1570, '<td valign="top">i like this a lot, nice, clear and tranquil - 10.</td>', 'i like this a lot, nice, clear and tranquil - 10.', '2003-05-30 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(310758, 22502, 8274, '<td valign="top">Not your''s I hope !</td>', 'Not your''s I hope !', '2003-05-30 09:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(310764, 22499, 8274, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot, well focused.</td>', 'Nice macro shot, well focused.', '2003-05-30 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(310780, 22995, 3417, '<td valign="top">good idea.  i never thought of this one.</td>', 'good idea.  i never thought of this one.', '2003-05-30 10:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(310788, 22880, 6721, '<td valign="top">This photo says "Home Sweet Home" is every way possible....right down to the clothes hanging on the line.  The detail is wonderful as are the colors.  Composition is very eye catching and very nicely put together.</td>', 'This photo says "Home Sweet Home" is every way possible....right down to the clothes hanging on the line.  The detail is wonderful as are the colors.  Composition is very eye catching and very nicely put together.', '2003-05-30 10:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(310791, 22289, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... I love the simplicity...</td>', 'excellent shot... I love the simplicity...', '2003-05-30 10:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(310805, 22293, 1570, '<td valign="top">hosting a gnome party?</td>', 'hosting a gnome party?', '2003-05-30 11:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(310826, 23019, 3540, '<td valign="top">The left side of the sky looks like its pixelating a little.  Great colors though and overall a really nice picture.  Very strange for midnight.  I don''t know if I could get used to that without a few sleepless nights.</td>', 'The left side of the sky looks like its pixelating a little.  Great colors though and overall a really nice picture.  Very strange for midnight.  I don''t know if I could get used to that without a few sleepless nights.', '2003-05-30 11:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(310827, 23006, 1202, '<td valign="top">Photograph the place you call home -- and be creative doing it!  You are obviously a talented photographer, but I think you completely missed the challenge.  2<br/></td>', 'Photograph the place you call home -- and be creative doing it!  You are obviously a talented photographer, but I think you completely missed the challenge.  2', '2003-05-30 11:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(310828, 23070, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors, but they look oversaturated.  This is still a good pic, definitely one of the better ones IMO.  Nice work</td>', 'Awesome colors, but they look oversaturated.  This is still a good pic, definitely one of the better ones IMO.  Nice work', '2003-05-30 11:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(310829, 22970, 6892, '<td valign="top">Home does center around good food and good people, doesn''t it? (Or: your stove looks like mine!)</td>', 'Home does center around good food and good people, doesn''t it? (Or: your stove looks like mine!)', '2003-05-30 11:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(310830, 22866, 3540, '<td valign="top">No fair.  I''m landscape challenged in my neck of the woods.  No pun intended.  Nice landscape though.  Great layers with the trees and mountains.  The haze adds a little extra layer of its own.  Good work.</td>', 'No fair.  I''m landscape challenged in my neck of the woods.  No pun intended.  Nice landscape though.  Great layers with the trees and mountains.  The haze adds a little extra layer of its own.  Good work.', '2003-05-30 11:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(310831, 22452, 6892, '<td valign="top">My favorite room!</td>', 'My favorite room!', '2003-05-30 11:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(310832, 22857, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very natural,homey setting.  Quite snap shoty, but works well here.  7</td>', 'A very natural,homey setting.  Quite snap shoty, but works well here.  7', '2003-05-30 11:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(310835, 22255, 1202, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge well, I wish you had gotten the focus sharper.  I don''t see a need for it being soft or I wouldn''t say anything.  The light is a bit harsh from the window.   6</td>', 'It meets the challenge well, I wish you had gotten the focus sharper.  I don''t see a need for it being soft or I wouldn''t say anything.  The light is a bit harsh from the window.   6', '2003-05-30 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(310836, 23027, 1202, '<td valign="top">By tieing the cat to the frame of the window you have met the challenge.  Nie sharp image and good use of light.  7</td>', 'By tieing the cat to the frame of the window you have met the challenge.  Nie sharp image and good use of light.  7', '2003-05-30 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(310837, 22970, 1202, '<td valign="top">Photograph the place you call home -- and be creative doing it!<br/>I am sorry but your picture does not carry the theme of the challenge for me.  If it were to show you working hard on preparing a meal, now that could mean "Home Sweet Home" to me.  2</td>', 'Photograph the place you call home -- and be creative doing it!I am sorry but your picture does not carry the theme of the challenge for me.  If it were to show you working hard on preparing a meal, now that could mean "Home Sweet Home" to me.  2', '2003-05-30 11:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(310839, 22288, 1202, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how you could have uploaded your entry from this old place.  Do you have wireless internet?   5</td>', 'I don''t see how you could have uploaded your entry from this old place.  Do you have wireless internet?   5', '2003-05-30 12:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(310844, 23013, 2764, '<td valign="top">The border is too heavy - Let the photo speak for itself - It''s a great photo but the border makes it feel crowded and too dark.</td>', 'The border is too heavy - Let the photo speak for itself - It''s a great photo but the border makes it feel crowded and too dark.', '2003-05-30 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(310845, 22980, 2764, '<td valign="top">Now here is a border that works - want to write us  a tutorial on balancing the border with the photo (which is also great) - 8</td>', 'Now here is a border that works - want to write us  a tutorial on balancing the border with the photo (which is also great) - 8', '2003-05-30 12:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(310846, 22857, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW - the winner!  A perfect 10 - I love a photo that makes me FEEL the air.</td>', 'Oh WOW - the winner!  A perfect 10 - I love a photo that makes me FEEL the air.', '2003-05-30 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
