(311092, 23004, 7436, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how to react to this image.  At first, I like it.  The lines are cool.  The contrast is intersting.  But the more I look at it, the more I don''t like it.  I almost with there was less data on the right side.  Or maybe it could be cropped tall just right of where it turns from white into black.</td>', 'I don''t know how to react to this image.  At first, I like it.  The lines are cool.  The contrast is intersting.  But the more I look at it, the more I don''t like it.  I almost with there was less data on the right side.  Or maybe it could be cropped tall just right of where it turns from white into black.', '2003-05-30 18:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(311093, 22857, 7436, '<td valign="top">You know.. I was really really liking this photo until I thought I saw a pair of sunglasses on the lady.  Is that right?  Or is that a trick of my eye?  Either way.. it looks like sunglasses, and, for some reason, that just really doesn''t work for me.  But I really like everything else.</td>', 'You know.. I was really really liking this photo until I thought I saw a pair of sunglasses on the lady.  Is that right?  Or is that a trick of my eye?  Either way.. it looks like sunglasses, and, for some reason, that just really doesn''t work for me.  But I really like everything else.', '2003-05-30 18:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
