(312707, 22621, 7743, '<td valign="top">I always like photos of roads or pathways where the trees arch over.  The only thing with this one is the feeling of a deadend.  I think it would be more appealling if one could see the end of the tunnel of trees.  I think more contrast would also help.</td>', 'I always like photos of roads or pathways where the trees arch over.  The only thing with this one is the feeling of a deadend.  I think it would be more appealling if one could see the end of the tunnel of trees.  I think more contrast would also help.', '2003-06-02 13:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(312709, 22919, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the sort of "calm before the storm" feeling of this picture.  Originally I felt that there was too much lawn and it could have been cropped closer, but I think that would have actually lessened the interest. Feels almost timeless.  Happy birthday! :)</td>', 'I like the sort of "calm before the storm" feeling of this picture.  Originally I felt that there was too much lawn and it could have been cropped closer, but I think that would have actually lessened the interest. Feels almost timeless.  Happy birthday! :)', '2003-06-02 13:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(312711, 22508, 6565, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  The expressiveness in the puppy''s face makes this photo work!  Could be a bit sharper, the goose in the background is distracting, etc., but the overall feel of this photo definitely says "home" to me.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  The expressiveness in the puppy''s face makes this photo work!  Could be a bit sharper, the goose in the background is distracting, etc., but the overall feel of this photo definitely says "home" to me.', '2003-06-02 13:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(312713, 22717, 6696, '<td valign="top">The shot is nice, but wow, what a cool fireplace.</td>', 'The shot is nice, but wow, what a cool fireplace.', '2003-06-02 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(312714, 22622, 7743, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the clouds and the house is amazing.  I always enjoy photos that have interesting clouds.  I think they add to the impact of the photo.  One thing here though is I think the house is a little crowded into the image.  Taking a different vantage point to show the complete left side of the roof and also capture some space on the right would have helped here.</td>', 'The contrast between the clouds and the house is amazing.  I always enjoy photos that have interesting clouds.  I think they add to the impact of the photo.  One thing here though is I think the house is a little crowded into the image.  Taking a different vantage point to show the complete left side of the roof and also capture some space on the right would have helped here.', '2003-06-02 13:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(312715, 22481, 6696, '<td valign="top">Would have done well not to be over saturated.</td>', 'Would have done well not to be over saturated.', '2003-06-02 13:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(312716, 23006, 6565, '<td valign="top">A beautiful macro shot, could be a tiny bit sharper.  Wouldn''t call it "the place YOU call home," as the challenge requests, and that loses a point from me.  I like the border being white next to the near-white background for contrast.  I think that helps the overall feel to not be too bland.</td>', 'A beautiful macro shot, could be a tiny bit sharper.  Wouldn''t call it "the place YOU call home," as the challenge requests, and that loses a point from me.  I like the border being white next to the near-white background for contrast.  I think that helps the overall feel to not be too bland.', '2003-06-02 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(312722, 23070, 6696, '<td valign="top">Gotta love that sky.  I like how the sky is seen through the holes in the building - gives it that old worn out charm.  8</td>', 'Gotta love that sky.  I like how the sky is seen through the holes in the building - gives it that old worn out charm.  8', '2003-06-02 13:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(312725, 22499, 6696, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Even the shadowing works here.  I would have scored hight, but It''s kind of a stetch on the challenge theme.  8</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Even the shadowing works here.  I would have scored hight, but It''s kind of a stetch on the challenge theme.  8', '2003-06-02 13:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(312726, 22980, 6696, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The sepia tones work well.  I may have gone with a diferent border.  9</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The sepia tones work well.  I may have gone with a diferent border.  9', '2003-06-02 13:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(312729, 22821, 6696, '<td valign="top">I am not so crazy about the angle, but the lighting is great. 7</td>', 'I am not so crazy about the angle, but the lighting is great. 7', '2003-06-02 13:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
