(312913, 23074, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I like the way that the land and the water adds alot of interest and value to the image.  There is also a lot of variety of color and pattern.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I like the way that the land and the water adds alot of interest and value to the image.  There is also a lot of variety of color and pattern.', '2003-06-02 15:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
