(312973, 22968, 811, '<td valign="top">This appears to me to have a lot of post processing to cover up some focus/technical issues.  Sorry, it just doesn''t appeal to me, though I think the basic subject is interesting.  maybe without the radioactive grass and stuff it would be okay.</td>', 'This appears to me to have a lot of post processing to cover up some focus/technical issues.  Sorry, it just doesn''t appeal to me, though I think the basic subject is interesting.  maybe without the radioactive grass and stuff it would be okay.', '2003-06-02 16:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(312977, 22822, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little "flat" to me, for obvious reasons.  Maybe it would be more interesting if I could relate to what was being shown, or if it was in more of a contextual setting.</td>', 'This shot is a little "flat" to me, for obvious reasons.  Maybe it would be more interesting if I could relate to what was being shown, or if it was in more of a contextual setting.', '2003-06-02 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(312981, 23059, 811, '<td valign="top">If you could have gotten closer, OR had a clearer focus, this shot would have been much more interesting and effective, I think.  The ant just kinda blends in with everything else.</td>', 'If you could have gotten closer, OR had a clearer focus, this shot would have been much more interesting and effective, I think.  The ant just kinda blends in with everything else.', '2003-06-02 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(312986, 23055, 811, '<td valign="top">The effectiveness of this shot is hurt by the lack of a clear focus.  Maybe a more dramatic angle would help too.</td>', 'The effectiveness of this shot is hurt by the lack of a clear focus.  Maybe a more dramatic angle would help too.', '2003-06-02 16:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(312990, 22624, 811, '<td valign="top">The dog and the pictures "fight" to be the focal point in this shot I think.  Neither really stands out as being THE subject.</td>', 'The dog and the pictures "fight" to be the focal point in this shot I think.  Neither really stands out as being THE subject.', '2003-06-02 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(312992, 22929, 811, '<td valign="top">Bizarre colors make me think your house is bizarre?  I think a lot of effective detail is being lost in this shot.  Maybe a little less of the red?</td>', 'Bizarre colors make me think your house is bizarre?  I think a lot of effective detail is being lost in this shot.  Maybe a little less of the red?', '2003-06-02 16:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(312994, 22877, 811, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the picture, but as a photograph, this seems a little flat to me.</td>', 'Good placement of the picture, but as a photograph, this seems a little flat to me.', '2003-06-02 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(313001, 22957, 811, '<td valign="top">Those cats must be wanting something, because I don''t know if it is possible to get them (cats in general) to actually do what you want.  Great capture.  I love the symmetry of the two, and the contrast of the colors is awesome.</td>', 'Those cats must be wanting something, because I don''t know if it is possible to get them (cats in general) to actually do what you want.  Great capture.  I love the symmetry of the two, and the contrast of the colors is awesome.', '2003-06-02 16:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(313003, 22980, 811, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and graceful.  I love how the stairs lead the eyes up and into the picture.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Very elegant and graceful.  I love how the stairs lead the eyes up and into the picture.  Excellent work.', '2003-06-02 16:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
