(313087, 22661, 9011, '<td valign="top">Wasnt'' this in another contest?</td>', 'Wasnt'' this in another contest?', '2003-06-02 17:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(313089, 23000, 9011, '<td valign="top">Captures real life in an artful way!  Good job!</td>', 'Captures real life in an artful way!  Good job!', '2003-06-02 17:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(313101, 22365, 6565, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait!  I just want to add, after having looked at this photo again and again over the week, that this is definitely a great example of everything a photo in this challenge should be, in my opinion.  The colors are rich, the composition is interesting and keeps the eye moving, and the title adds a neat personal descriptiveness that you don''t otherwise get.  The white sky on the right is a bit blown out, which is a peeve of mine, but I''m changing my score on this from a 9 to a 10 because I really hope to see it in first place!  Well done! :)</td>', 'Lovely portrait!  I just want to add, after having looked at this photo again and again over the week, that this is definitely a great example of everything a photo in this challenge should be, in my opinion.  The colors are rich, the composition is interesting and keeps the eye moving, and the title adds a neat personal descriptiveness that you don''t otherwise get.  The white sky on the right is a bit blown out, which is a peeve of mine, but I''m changing my score on this from a 9 to a 10 because I really hope to see it in first place!  Well done! :)', '2003-06-02 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313102, 22822, 2801, '<td valign="top">Visual Studio 6? I think you should put space between if and ( and no space between functions and (. Other than it''s a 10. ;P</td>', 'Visual Studio 6? I think you should put space between if and ( and no space between functions and (. Other than it''s a 10. ;P', '2003-06-02 17:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(313104, 22857, 6565, '<td valign="top">This photo creates such a timeless feel!  I generally don''t like portraits of people, but this really hits home with the "home sweet home" theme.  Very well done!  (Addendum -- the only feedback I''d give is to remove the sunglasses on the model on the left.  They are a little distracting and do hint at the image being modern.)</td>', 'This photo creates such a timeless feel!  I generally don''t like portraits of people, but this really hits home with the "home sweet home" theme.  Very well done!  (Addendum -- the only feedback I''d give is to remove the sunglasses on the model on the left.  They are a little distracting and do hint at the image being modern.)', '2003-06-02 18:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(313106, 22615, 2801, '<td valign="top">Mmm... looks like my other home. Pretty!</td>', 'Mmm... looks like my other home. Pretty!', '2003-06-02 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313108, 22958, 6565, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t necessarily the place YOU call home, I love the expression on the kitten''s face and how the blue in the can picks up the blue in his eyes.  And it''s not too hard to imagine that the can is FROM your home, perhaps, or that the kitten is part of your family.  It''s a very "cute" (sorry) photo. :)</td>', 'While this isn''t necessarily the place YOU call home, I love the expression on the kitten''s face and how the blue in the can picks up the blue in his eyes.  And it''s not too hard to imagine that the can is FROM your home, perhaps, or that the kitten is part of your family.  It''s a very "cute" (sorry) photo. :)', '2003-06-02 18:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313109, 23003, 2801, '<td valign="top">*phew* what a shirt! :)</td>', '*phew* what a shirt! :)', '2003-06-02 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(313112, 22789, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the postcard feel of the border on this image, and the title in this case does add to the image.  I find the branches on the right a little distracting but overall really like the mood.</td>', 'I love the postcard feel of the border on this image, and the title in this case does add to the image.  I find the branches on the right a little distracting but overall really like the mood.', '2003-06-02 18:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(313116, 22489, 6565, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped the top some so that the horizon was higher.  Took me a second to realize these were row houses.  But once I did, that added to the emotion of the image.  The birds are a nice touch.</td>', 'I''d have cropped the top some so that the horizon was higher.  Took me a second to realize these were row houses.  But once I did, that added to the emotion of the image.  The birds are a nice touch.', '2003-06-02 18:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313119, 23025, 2801, '<td valign="top">See you there soon! ;) (Pretty donkey!  Ok.. just kidding)</td>', 'See you there soon! ;) (Pretty donkey!  Ok.. just kidding)', '2003-06-02 18:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(313120, 23023, 6565, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this image that works somehow, even though the subject itself is not particularly exciting.  The contrast could be cranked up a little bit more, but in general I don''t know why I like it, but I do. :)</td>', 'There''s something about this image that works somehow, even though the subject itself is not particularly exciting.  The contrast could be cranked up a little bit more, but in general I don''t know why I like it, but I do. :)', '2003-06-02 18:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(313125, 22408, 6565, '<td valign="top">My only minus about this image is that I''d like to be able to see the ground a bit more.  I feel as though I''m craning my neck upward to look at this, and can''t look back down.  Overall, the tones are nice, and the fog adds mystery.  Nice composition as well, other than the ground issue.</td>', 'My only minus about this image is that I''d like to be able to see the ground a bit more.  I feel as though I''m craning my neck upward to look at this, and can''t look back down.  Overall, the tones are nice, and the fog adds mystery.  Nice composition as well, other than the ground issue.', '2003-06-02 18:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
