(313137, 22896, 6565, '<td valign="top">Of all the sort of run-down "fixer upper" interpretations of this challenge, I liked this one the best.  It''s very jigsaw puzzle-able in its crisp lines and bright colors.  Definitely the best light that house will be shown in.... :)</td>', 'Of all the sort of run-down "fixer upper" interpretations of this challenge, I liked this one the best.  It''s very jigsaw puzzle-able in its crisp lines and bright colors.  Definitely the best light that house will be shown in.... :)', '2003-06-02 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313138, 22888, 2801, '<td valign="top">pretty cool!</td>', 'pretty cool!', '2003-06-02 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(313141, 22888, 6565, '<td valign="top">The centered magnifying glass with the vertical being juuuuuust off-perpendicular is a little distracting, would have preferred more of an angle on the glass'' handle.  I like the very literal interpretation, complete with "heart" drawn on.  Very cute.  It conveys the information you want to convey, just would have preferred a slightly less formal composition.</td>', 'The centered magnifying glass with the vertical being juuuuuust off-perpendicular is a little distracting, would have preferred more of an angle on the glass'' handle.  I like the very literal interpretation, complete with "heart" drawn on.  Very cute.  It conveys the information you want to convey, just would have preferred a slightly less formal composition.', '2003-06-02 18:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(313142, 22653, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the home-within-your-home idea, and especially that the bird inside looks so snug and possessive of the little house!  Looks sharp and focused, composition is nice, might try boosting saturation a little and see what it looks like, just for kicks.</td>', 'I love the home-within-your-home idea, and especially that the bird inside looks so snug and possessive of the little house!  Looks sharp and focused, composition is nice, might try boosting saturation a little and see what it looks like, just for kicks.', '2003-06-02 18:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(313143, 22968, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the painterly effect on this photo.  Only suggestion would be to move the post either up a little or down a little so it''s not quite so centered vertically.</td>', 'I like the painterly effect on this photo.  Only suggestion would be to move the post either up a little or down a little so it''s not quite so centered vertically.', '2003-06-02 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313144, 22404, 6565, '<td valign="top">Another one of those images that I keep coming back to over and over during the week.  It definitely has a mood of peace and quiet in it.  The plant on the right is just a bit too much of a contrast to ignore, but not enough of a contrast to see very well.  Would recommend either cropping it out entirely or playing with balance to see if you can get it more into view.</td>', 'Another one of those images that I keep coming back to over and over during the week.  It definitely has a mood of peace and quiet in it.  The plant on the right is just a bit too much of a contrast to ignore, but not enough of a contrast to see very well.  Would recommend either cropping it out entirely or playing with balance to see if you can get it more into view.', '2003-06-02 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(313146, 23057, 6565, '<td valign="top">This one really strikes me -- I like the concept, the only thing that doesn''t work for me is that the picture on the left isn''t pure B&amp;W like the others.  I find that distracting.  Other than that, very nice!</td>', 'This one really strikes me -- I like the concept, the only thing that doesn''t work for me is that the picture on the left isn''t pure B&W like the others.  I find that distracting.  Other than that, very nice!', '2003-06-02 18:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(313147, 22821, 6565, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at, here, but I like it. :)</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at, here, but I like it. :)', '2003-06-02 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313149, 22402, 6565, '<td valign="top">This image is one of the ones I came back to later.  I like the mundane-ness of it, and how that can really convey the "home" feeling.  The blurry whatever-it-is in the upper right is distracting, but I like the crispness of the red clothes against the greenish drying rack.  Just upgraded ya a point.  Nice work!</td>', 'This image is one of the ones I came back to later.  I like the mundane-ness of it, and how that can really convey the "home" feeling.  The blurry whatever-it-is in the upper right is distracting, but I like the crispness of the red clothes against the greenish drying rack.  Just upgraded ya a point.  Nice work!', '2003-06-02 18:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(313153, 22774, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice angle. I like the distance from the house, but I don''t see the value in the foreground and would probably have cut it out if this was my shot. :)</td>', 'nice angle. I like the distance from the house, but I don''t see the value in the foreground and would probably have cut it out if this was my shot. :)', '2003-06-02 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(313157, 23067, 7711, '<td valign="top">reminds me of a magazine shot, doesn''t feel enough like refuge because of the inclusion of the side tables..I would have gotten a little closer to the bed. :)</td>', 'reminds me of a magazine shot, doesn''t feel enough like refuge because of the inclusion of the side tables..I would have gotten a little closer to the bed. :)', '2003-06-02 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(313158, 22857, 7711, '<td valign="top">bit of a stretch on the challenge, but I''ll give it to ya. :) Nice shot, good use of duotones. I like the graininess as well. Only nit is the pixely sky, but its not a big problem.</td>', 'bit of a stretch on the challenge, but I''ll give it to ya. :) Nice shot, good use of duotones. I like the graininess as well. Only nit is the pixely sky, but its not a big problem.', '2003-06-02 18:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(313160, 23012, 7711, '<td valign="top">guess: its an upsidedown reflection of your house in your car hood? Phew, that was a lot of work to figure out! I don''t know if that was what you wanted us to have to do, but when we do have to work that hard to figure it out, it detracts from the impact of the photo. I like the reflection though, its a very creative idea bringing home and travel together.</td>', 'guess: its an upsidedown reflection of your house in your car hood? Phew, that was a lot of work to figure out! I don''t know if that was what you wanted us to have to do, but when we do have to work that hard to figure it out, it detracts from the impact of the photo. I like the reflection though, its a very creative idea bringing home and travel together.', '2003-06-02 18:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(313162, 23025, 7711, '<td valign="top">this feels like a postcard and a place I''d like to visit. Nicely done.</td>', 'this feels like a postcard and a place I''d like to visit. Nicely done.', '2003-06-02 19:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(313170, 22991, 7711, '<td valign="top">very literal interpretation of the challenge. I think you used your flash here, which has the effect of being too bright in the foreground, leaving the rest of the shot looking dark. Nothing else really wrong with it, except that its not the most rivetting composition.  I think that will probably explain your placement more than anything. There just isn''t any interest in the shot besides a documentation of your livingroom. :) (lovely and cosy though it seems!)</td>', 'very literal interpretation of the challenge. I think you used your flash here, which has the effect of being too bright in the foreground, leaving the rest of the shot looking dark. Nothing else really wrong with it, except that its not the most rivetting composition.  I think that will probably explain your placement more than anything. There just isn''t any interest in the shot besides a documentation of your livingroom. :) (lovely and cosy though it seems!)', '2003-06-02 19:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(313173, 23077, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think this is a stretch on the challenge, and probably your score will reflect that reality. But the picture itself is really good, though I would have cropped a bit off the top of the shot and did somethnig different with the borders, they are uneven. Did you use even or odd numbers of pixels to create it? If you use even numbers, you always get even borders. I like the focus on the eye, and the slight out of focus of the beak, it softens the image.</td>', 'i think this is a stretch on the challenge, and probably your score will reflect that reality. But the picture itself is really good, though I would have cropped a bit off the top of the shot and did somethnig different with the borders, they are uneven. Did you use even or odd numbers of pixels to create it? If you use even numbers, you always get even borders. I like the focus on the eye, and the slight out of focus of the beak, it softens the image.', '2003-06-02 19:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(313175, 22888, 7711, '<td valign="top">very cute idea. :) I like the inclusion of the hand and the magnifying glass. :)</td>', 'very cute idea. :) I like the inclusion of the hand and the magnifying glass. :)', '2003-06-02 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
