(313402, 22250, 6325, '<td valign="top">Several interesting elements in your photo. Did you try it with a black and white?</td>', 'Several interesting elements in your photo. Did you try it with a black and white?', '2003-06-02 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(313408, 22477, 6325, '<td valign="top">Inviting image.</td>', 'Inviting image.', '2003-06-02 23:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(313410, 22404, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Might have gone without the plant - leave some mystery as to what else is there.</td>', 'Good concept. Might have gone without the plant - leave some mystery as to what else is there.', '2003-06-02 23:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313412, 22621, 6325, '<td valign="top">Real mystery here. The depth created by the light to dark tones is dramatic.</td>', 'Real mystery here. The depth created by the light to dark tones is dramatic.', '2003-06-02 23:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313417, 22404, 9011, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast</td>', 'Nice contrast', '2003-06-02 23:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313419, 22615, 9011, '<td valign="top">Very pretty</td>', 'Very pretty', '2003-06-02 23:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(313421, 22508, 6325, '<td valign="top">LOL. Just too cute. This captures home alright.</td>', 'LOL. Just too cute. This captures home alright.', '2003-06-02 23:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(313423, 22942, 6325, '<td valign="top">Like the abstractcomposition.Contrast treatment adds to the interest.</td>', 'Like the abstractcomposition.Contrast treatment adds to the interest.', '2003-06-02 23:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(313425, 22880, 9011, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the filter.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the filter.', '2003-06-02 23:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(313426, 23027, 8488, '<td valign="top">Both cute and dignified (as a cat should be). I like the composition.</td>', 'Both cute and dignified (as a cat should be). I like the composition.', '2003-06-02 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(313428, 22844, 8488, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but I really like the composition/framing on this one. It''s the kind of shot I go for a lot (shapeswise), but rarely manage to get anything I like from.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but I really like the composition/framing on this one. It''s the kind of shot I go for a lot (shapeswise), but rarely manage to get anything I like from.', '2003-06-02 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(313429, 22857, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very homey. Well done.</td>', 'Very homey. Well done.', '2003-06-02 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(313431, 22957, 8488, '<td valign="top">Cute pose, but a little blown out towards the white end, I think.</td>', 'Cute pose, but a little blown out towards the white end, I think.', '2003-06-02 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313432, 22255, 8488, '<td valign="top">Endearing subject, well lit and posed ... but he''s too blurry. If you couldn''t get the focus, you could at least make the shot a little smaller to help sharpen it up.</td>', 'Endearing subject, well lit and posed ... but he''s too blurry. If you couldn''t get the focus, you could at least make the shot a little smaller to help sharpen it up.', '2003-06-02 23:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(313434, 22303, 8488, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good idea and angle ... but the contrast between foreground (signs) and background (building) is not amazingly apparent, causing Madison to kind of fade away.</td>', 'Nice composition, good idea and angle ... but the contrast between foreground (signs) and background (building) is not amazingly apparent, causing Madison to kind of fade away.', '2003-06-02 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(313436, 22508, 8488, '<td valign="top">(as my hindbrain gooshes, "Cute Puppy!!!")<br/> <br/>Appealing subject and pose; good lighting. Keeping this shot an 8 and not a 10, though, is the focus, which is kind of all over the place. The dog''s nose, the flower, the sign, the bricks, or SOMETHING other than the stairs behind the dog need to be in crisp focus to draw the eye. :-&gt;</td>', '(as my hindbrain gooshes, "Cute Puppy!!!") Appealing subject and pose; good lighting. Keeping this shot an 8 and not a 10, though, is the focus, which is kind of all over the place. The dog''s nose, the flower, the sign, the bricks, or SOMETHING other than the stairs behind the dog need to be in crisp focus to draw the eye. :->', '2003-06-02 23:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(313437, 22622, 8488, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous crisp ''cut from paper'' clouds above.</td>', 'Gorgeous crisp ''cut from paper'' clouds above.', '2003-06-02 23:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(313439, 22621, 8488, '<td valign="top">This road, as shot, looks disturbingly like an esophagus. Which isn''t necessarily a *bad* thing .. great lighting, contrasts, angle. Like it a lot. 9.</td>', 'This road, as shot, looks disturbingly like an esophagus. Which isn''t necessarily a *bad* thing .. great lighting, contrasts, angle. Like it a lot. 9.', '2003-06-02 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(313440, 23055, 8488, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t blurry, 8. However, as-is, 5.</td>', 'If it weren''t blurry, 8. However, as-is, 5.', '2003-06-03 00:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313441, 23040, 8488, '<td valign="top">I somehow think this will finish in the top ten; it''s just ''the right kind of shot'' to do so. :-&gt; And I don''t disagree that it''s nice; 8. Better/clearer focus (anywhere!) might have bumped it up for me.</td>', 'I somehow think this will finish in the top ten; it''s just ''the right kind of shot'' to do so. :-> And I don''t disagree that it''s nice; 8. Better/clearer focus (anywhere!) might have bumped it up for me.', '2003-06-03 00:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313443, 22929, 8488, '<td valign="top">The pumped saturation is, for me, kind of distracting, but that''s a personal choice. If it accentuated the composition or helped direct the eye, it might not detract from my vote; but as it is, combined with the utter lack of focus anywhere in the frame, 4.</td>', 'The pumped saturation is, for me, kind of distracting, but that''s a personal choice. If it accentuated the composition or helped direct the eye, it might not detract from my vote; but as it is, combined with the utter lack of focus anywhere in the frame, 4.', '2003-06-03 00:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(313444, 22884, 8488, '<td valign="top">Interesting focus effect (blurry to the sides, sharp in the middle). Trick lens, vaseline, or zoom effect? I just wish what was centered and focussed (in this case, dirt) were more interesting. 6.</td>', 'Interesting focus effect (blurry to the sides, sharp in the middle). Trick lens, vaseline, or zoom effect? I just wish what was centered and focussed (in this case, dirt) were more interesting. 6.', '2003-06-03 00:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(313445, 22497, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s just unappealing, I''m afraid. The composition says, "I''m trying to do something, here!" and I''m left answering, "Yeah, but what??"</td>', 'It''s just unappealing, I''m afraid. The composition says, "I''m trying to do something, here!" and I''m left answering, "Yeah, but what??"', '2003-06-03 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313447, 23057, 8488, '<td valign="top">Nice concept; all the color artifacts (from low lighting and post-production to brighten?) are really distracting, though.</td>', 'Nice concept; all the color artifacts (from low lighting and post-production to brighten?) are really distracting, though.', '2003-06-03 00:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(313450, 22849, 8488, '<td valign="top">Incredibly cute. :-&gt; Also well-composed and decently lit (little too much glare - paper towel over the lamp next time?). I love the eyes just peeping in from behind.</td>', 'Incredibly cute. :-> Also well-composed and decently lit (little too much glare - paper towel over the lamp next time?). I love the eyes just peeping in from behind.', '2003-06-03 00:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(313451, 22408, 8488, '<td valign="top">I kind of dislike soft-focus-and-overexposed when there doesn''t seem to be any reason for it. In this case, it feels like I''m looking at the picture through a dirty window.</td>', 'I kind of dislike soft-focus-and-overexposed when there doesn''t seem to be any reason for it. In this case, it feels like I''m looking at the picture through a dirty window.', '2003-06-03 00:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(313452, 22916, 8488, '<td valign="top">An all right shot, but more of a snapshot than a portrait (framing choice, composition, and lighting, really). 5.</td>', 'An all right shot, but more of a snapshot than a portrait (framing choice, composition, and lighting, really). 5.', '2003-06-03 00:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313465, 22982, 7743, '<td valign="top">As the title indicates (and the challenge topic), the main subject should be the shell not the turtle.  Ignoring this, the image is composed and exposed well.</td>', 'As the title indicates (and the challenge topic), the main subject should be the shell not the turtle.  Ignoring this, the image is composed and exposed well.', '2003-06-03 00:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(313467, 22880, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the supersaturated treatment for this shot. Very homey feel.</td>', 'I like the supersaturated treatment for this shot. Very homey feel.', '2003-06-03 00:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313468, 23011, 7743, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset.  Unfortunately it takes the attention here and not the airplane.  The airplane is too small to be the main subject in this image.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset.  Unfortunately it takes the attention here and not the airplane.  The airplane is too small to be the main subject in this image.', '2003-06-03 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(313473, 22880, 7743, '<td valign="top">The image appears to be slightly overexposed.  To get a better angle on the tractors I would have tried a different vantage point.</td>', 'The image appears to be slightly overexposed.  To get a better angle on the tractors I would have tried a different vantage point.', '2003-06-03 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313485, 22659, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Sharpen the focus, crop out a bit more of the tree on the right and you''ll have  a photo with more impact.  IMO the bird is too central.</td>', 'Nice macro.  Sharpen the focus, crop out a bit more of the tree on the right and you''ll have  a photo with more impact.  IMO the bird is too central.', '2003-06-03 00:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(313486, 22821, 9097, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors. Stunning.<br/> <br/>Paul<br/></td>', 'Wonderful colors. Stunning. Paul', '2003-06-03 00:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313519, 23079, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good color capture.  My house has one of those chimneys too - I''m just not sure if I''d see it as a representation of home.  If you see it that way, I''ll go along with it.</td>', 'Good color capture.  My house has one of those chimneys too - I''m just not sure if I''d see it as a representation of home.  If you see it that way, I''ll go along with it.', '2003-06-03 01:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(313521, 22262, 2000, '<td valign="top">With the plants there, this doesn''t seem quite right in B/W - the plants look kind of like a mangled plastic bag or something to me.  Sorry, but this would have worked better in color.</td>', 'With the plants there, this doesn''t seem quite right in B/W - the plants look kind of like a mangled plastic bag or something to me.  Sorry, but this would have worked better in color.', '2003-06-03 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(313551, 22853, 7339, '<td valign="top">Beautiful I wish it were my home. Very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful I wish it were my home. Very nice!', '2003-06-03 02:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(313556, 22861, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love this!! Flower and pet in the same shot and it still can be said to be relevant to the challenge! you are to be commended. :)</td>', 'I love this!! Flower and pet in the same shot and it still can be said to be relevant to the challenge! you are to be commended. :)', '2003-06-03 03:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(313557, 22907, 7711, '<td valign="top">very cool that the word "mobile" is also on the glass. Often these shots are thought of as exploitation, but homelessness is a reality none of us should ignore. Thank you for showing us this. There is an anonymity of this man with his head cut out of the shot.</td>', 'very cool that the word "mobile" is also on the glass. Often these shots are thought of as exploitation, but homelessness is a reality none of us should ignore. Thank you for showing us this. There is an anonymity of this man with his head cut out of the shot.', '2003-06-03 03:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(313558, 23072, 7711, '<td valign="top">this colouring really works well for the shot. I like your angle and the background, its all very rustic and old looking, without being run down. :)</td>', 'this colouring really works well for the shot. I like your angle and the background, its all very rustic and old looking, without being run down. :)', '2003-06-03 03:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313559, 22847, 7711, '<td valign="top">though I think an argument could be made that this is a shot showing the place you call home, I can''t really see it from the picture, and can''t in good conscious agree that this is a right interpretation even with the most liberal of definitions! Great shot though, I like the composition with one balloon near and cut off and the other in the sky. Nicely done.</td>', 'though I think an argument could be made that this is a shot showing the place you call home, I can''t really see it from the picture, and can''t in good conscious agree that this is a right interpretation even with the most liberal of definitions! Great shot though, I like the composition with one balloon near and cut off and the other in the sky. Nicely done.', '2003-06-03 03:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313560, 22306, 7711, '<td valign="top">this shot makes me smile. :) I hate the use of the onboard flash, but the lighting wasn''t good and you needed something to illluminate the scene. Not sure it fits the challenge all that well, but its a candid full of emotion. I like it.</td>', 'this shot makes me smile. :) I hate the use of the onboard flash, but the lighting wasn''t good and you needed something to illluminate the scene. Not sure it fits the challenge all that well, but its a candid full of emotion. I like it.', '2003-06-03 03:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
