(313706, 22622, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great clouds! Good lighting of a fascinating property which leaves me feeling slightly uneasy (in an Addams family kind of way).</td>', 'Great clouds! Good lighting of a fascinating property which leaves me feeling slightly uneasy (in an Addams family kind of way).', '2003-06-03 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(313710, 23077, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a star!</td>', 'What a star!', '2003-06-03 10:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313715, 22659, 8860, '<td valign="top">There''s something slightly surreal about that sparrow - I can''t put my finger on it... could be the flash. Nice study despite the slight movement.</td>', 'There''s something slightly surreal about that sparrow - I can''t put my finger on it... could be the flash. Nice study despite the slight movement.', '2003-06-03 11:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(313716, 23048, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice image this. Good tones and lighting with plenty of detail. A little flavour of someone else''s world...</td>', 'Very nice image this. Good tones and lighting with plenty of detail. A little flavour of someone else''s world...', '2003-06-03 11:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(313717, 22740, 8860, '<td valign="top">Do you live in a bird-box? Great view - nothing else like it...</td>', 'Do you live in a bird-box? Great view - nothing else like it...', '2003-06-03 11:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(313719, 22884, 8242, '<td valign="top">interesting effect.</td>', 'interesting effect.', '2003-06-03 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(313720, 23065, 8860, '<td valign="top">Do I spy some spot editing? Or is the world now black &amp; white with red bits?</td>', 'Do I spy some spot editing? Or is the world now black & white with red bits?', '2003-06-03 11:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(313721, 22428, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is marvellous. Sometimes to offer critique is simply misplaced - I just like it. A lot.</td>', 'This is marvellous. Sometimes to offer critique is simply misplaced - I just like it. A lot.', '2003-06-03 11:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(313729, 22880, 8860, '<td valign="top">This image is very artistic in its composition. In this instance the blur/overlay-style effects applied enhance rather than detract from its appeal. Love it - very ''Darling Buds''.</td>', 'This image is very artistic in its composition. In this instance the blur/overlay-style effects applied enhance rather than detract from its appeal. Love it - very ''Darling Buds''.', '2003-06-03 11:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313730, 22272, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well of course!</td>', 'Well of course!', '2003-06-03 11:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(313740, 22452, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes, yes, yes. This is more like it - the contents of a fridge with some French food descriptions. Instant fascination. A good shot too. Lots of detail with good ambient light.</td>', 'Yes, yes, yes. This is more like it - the contents of a fridge with some French food descriptions. Instant fascination. A good shot too. Lots of detail with good ambient light.', '2003-06-03 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(313741, 22477, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a great pic of a lovely home. Isn''t nature great?</td>', 'What a great pic of a lovely home. Isn''t nature great?', '2003-06-03 11:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(313745, 22857, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great shot, catches the emotion of home, at least for me.  Nice use of the effect too.   I almost wish you covered  the "home" with the laundry, but I can see for this challenge why didn''t.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Great shot, catches the emotion of home, at least for me.  Nice use of the effect too.   I almost wish you covered  the "home" with the laundry, but I can see for this challenge why didn''t.  Very nice job.', '2003-06-03 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(313746, 22477, 7969, '<td valign="top">Really like the amount of grass you left in the foreground.</td>', 'Really like the amount of grass you left in the foreground.', '2003-06-03 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(313747, 22836, 7969, '<td valign="top">Creative shot.</td>', 'Creative shot.', '2003-06-03 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(313748, 22634, 8860, '<td valign="top">That''s a big backyard. What a great, mind-expanding view. Image is clear and inspiring.</td>', 'That''s a big backyard. What a great, mind-expanding view. Image is clear and inspiring.', '2003-06-03 12:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313752, 22991, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a ''normal'' house!</td>', 'Nice to see a ''normal'' house!', '2003-06-03 12:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(313755, 22987, 8488, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t blurry, this could easily be an 8 or 9 for me ... as it is, 6.</td>', 'If it weren''t blurry, this could easily be an 8 or 9 for me ... as it is, 6.', '2003-06-03 12:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(313757, 22976, 7711, '<td valign="top">this is really great. its almost not welcoming because of all the overgrowth. Nice work with the duotone greens too. :)</td>', 'this is really great. its almost not welcoming because of all the overgrowth. Nice work with the duotone greens too. :)', '2003-06-03 12:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(313758, 22982, 7711, '<td valign="top">is he sticking his tongue out? :) Cool shot, though not quite the place you call home, it is that turtle''s. I think I would have liked to see a little more of his shell in this shot.</td>', 'is he sticking his tongue out? :) Cool shot, though not quite the place you call home, it is that turtle''s. I think I would have liked to see a little more of his shell in this shot.', '2003-06-03 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313762, 22968, 7711, '<td valign="top">interesting old effect on this shot, make the photo look ancient.</td>', 'interesting old effect on this shot, make the photo look ancient.', '2003-06-03 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(313765, 22624, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think a nice frame, maybe 14 pixels of white or something would really set this shot off nicely. Very warm scene, I like the pictures on the wall. :)</td>', 'I think a nice frame, maybe 14 pixels of white or something would really set this shot off nicely. Very warm scene, I like the pictures on the wall. :)', '2003-06-03 12:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(313767, 22875, 7711, '<td valign="top">cool abstract, not fond of the glare in the lower right corner, I think lower light that played on the metals might have worked better. :)</td>', 'cool abstract, not fond of the glare in the lower right corner, I think lower light that played on the metals might have worked better. :)', '2003-06-03 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313772, 22501, 7711, '<td valign="top">its a little too dark I think to really bring out the details, though seems like a beautiful home. Try to take the picture at a different time of day when the light is more flattering to make the shot look less like a snapshot. :)</td>', 'its a little too dark I think to really bring out the details, though seems like a beautiful home. Try to take the picture at a different time of day when the light is more flattering to make the shot look less like a snapshot. :)', '2003-06-03 13:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(313773, 22919, 7711, '<td valign="top">i would have cut out a little more of the foreground to balance the shot. BW/sepia adds a bit of emotion to the shot. :)</td>', 'i would have cut out a little more of the foreground to balance the shot. BW/sepia adds a bit of emotion to the shot. :)', '2003-06-03 13:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(313776, 22404, 7711, '<td valign="top">not fond of the tilt on the window,it seems your camera needed to be higher up.  I like the lines on the chair from the light and the bw. :)</td>', 'not fond of the tilt on the window,it seems your camera needed to be higher up.  I like the lines on the chair from the light and the bw. :)', '2003-06-03 13:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(313778, 22662, 9089, '<td valign="top">Central Perk Coffee Shop, and pouring hot water... believing in the Instant are ya?  Like the composition, but don''t like the colored tile partially coming out from behind the pot nor the fact that it makes you look pregnant :-)</td>', 'Central Perk Coffee Shop, and pouring hot water... believing in the Instant are ya?  Like the composition, but don''t like the colored tile partially coming out from behind the pot nor the fact that it makes you look pregnant :-)', '2003-06-03 13:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(313779, 22857, 9089, '<td valign="top">To me it clashes, the mobile home? and mom''s dress style being more modern, with the color cast trying to make it look like an old pic.</td>', 'To me it clashes, the mobile home? and mom''s dress style being more modern, with the color cast trying to make it look like an old pic.', '2003-06-03 13:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(313783, 22622, 7711, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see this how presented with a wider angle and landscape rather than portrait, seems like a very pretty manor. I like the clouds you''ve captured though, they add interest. :)</td>', 'I would have loved to see this how presented with a wider angle and landscape rather than portrait, seems like a very pretty manor. I like the clouds you''ve captured though, they add interest. :)', '2003-06-03 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
