(313793, 22883, 6740, '<td valign="top">It may not an exact fit for the "Home Sweet Home" topic (in my opinion) but is still a good photo.  Nice, clear and in focus. Good Luck.<br/></td>', 'It may not an exact fit for the "Home Sweet Home" topic (in my opinion) but is still a good photo.  Nice, clear and in focus. Good Luck.', '2003-06-03 13:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
