(313815, 22992, 8860, '<td valign="top">I really like this - perfect angle and composition. Fun to close my browser window down and scroll wheel the image so that it ''animates''. Very good DOF and some lovely texture, colour and tone. Whether it''s a home or not I dunno (perhaps someone''s working too hard!) but it''s one of my favourites.</td>', 'I really like this - perfect angle and composition. Fun to close my browser window down and scroll wheel the image so that it ''animates''. Very good DOF and some lovely texture, colour and tone. Whether it''s a home or not I dunno (perhaps someone''s working too hard!) but it''s one of my favourites.', '2003-06-03 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(313816, 22341, 9089, '<td valign="top">I would have titled it "Future Home Site"</td>', 'I would have titled it "Future Home Site"', '2003-06-03 13:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
