(314128, 23011, 9089, '<td valign="top">Now being an American Missionary living in Minsk, Belarus, this photo has more impact on me than probably on most, but this is a great concept for me on HSH.  Thanks.   Maybe title it "Going Home"  That''s what I thought the title was when I was looking at, and then went back and noticed it a little different.</td>', 'Now being an American Missionary living in Minsk, Belarus, this photo has more impact on me than probably on most, but this is a great concept for me on HSH.  Thanks.   Maybe title it "Going Home"  That''s what I thought the title was when I was looking at, and then went back and noticed it a little different.', '2003-06-03 17:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(314131, 22508, 5585, '<td valign="top">and of course .....a goose ?....cute pic...</td>', 'and of course .....a goose ?....cute pic...', '2003-06-03 17:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(314132, 22477, 9089, '<td valign="top">Maybe taking the picture from the other corner and get the back door into it more may add a little more interest to the photo, this corner being empty makes it uninteresting</td>', 'Maybe taking the picture from the other corner and get the back door into it more may add a little more interest to the photo, this corner being empty makes it uninteresting', '2003-06-03 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
