(314138, 22969, 9089, '<td valign="top">The power lines give the photo interest, but the back of that sign just leaves me wanting to know what it was.  Also, the green looks just a little bright.</td>', 'The power lines give the photo interest, but the back of that sign just leaves me wanting to know what it was.  Also, the green looks just a little bright.', '2003-06-03 17:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
