(314335, 23027, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  White is hard to get detail, but you managed it very well!  The cat''s expression matches up with your title very well.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  White is hard to get detail, but you managed it very well!  The cat''s expression matches up with your title very well.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-03 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
