(314346, 23016, 7743, '<td valign="top">For more impact I would have cropped out the tea cup and plates, leaving only the nice shiny toaster and colourful reflection, maybe catch more of the lily and jam jar in the reflection.  The flowers in the window are a distraction.</td>', 'For more impact I would have cropped out the tea cup and plates, leaving only the nice shiny toaster and colourful reflection, maybe catch more of the lily and jam jar in the reflection.  The flowers in the window are a distraction.', '2003-06-03 21:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(314348, 22884, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good choice of camera filter for this image though I would have tried to get more of the heron(?) in the center (clear) part of the image or, if such a thing exists, use a camera filter where the clear area is off center.</td>', 'Good choice of camera filter for this image though I would have tried to get more of the heron(?) in the center (clear) part of the image or, if such a thing exists, use a camera filter where the clear area is off center.', '2003-06-03 21:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(314351, 22849, 7743, '<td valign="top">Including more of the child''s eyes would make this image even more endearing.</td>', 'Including more of the child''s eyes would make this image even more endearing.', '2003-06-03 21:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(314353, 22508, 7743, '<td valign="top">First rule of composition..... look around the frame before clicking the shutter.  Cosby has something growing out of his head.  Focus seems a little soft as well.  A faster shutter speed would probably have helped with this.  Exposure looks good though.</td>', 'First rule of composition..... look around the frame before clicking the shutter.  Cosby has something growing out of his head.  Focus seems a little soft as well.  A faster shutter speed would probably have helped with this.  Exposure looks good though.', '2003-06-03 21:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(314355, 23077, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good composition and exposure.  A little more DOF would help with impact.  Enough DOF to include the entire beak and eye I think would be enough.</td>', 'Good composition and exposure.  A little more DOF would help with impact.  Enough DOF to include the entire beak and eye I think would be enough.', '2003-06-03 21:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(314356, 22853, 7743, '<td valign="top">Exposure seems good and composition on the most part is ok.  One thing I might have done would be to take a lower vantage point to fill the frame with more grass and less sky.  An alternative would be to have more sky and less grass but I don''t think that would have as much impact since the green is so vivd.</td>', 'Exposure seems good and composition on the most part is ok.  One thing I might have done would be to take a lower vantage point to fill the frame with more grass and less sky.  An alternative would be to have more sky and less grass but I don''t think that would have as much impact since the green is so vivd.', '2003-06-03 21:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(314358, 23012, 7743, '<td valign="top">This just looks upside down.  To add impact I think you could have included more reflection and less of the real thing.</td>', 'This just looks upside down.  To add impact I think you could have included more reflection and less of the real thing.', '2003-06-03 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(314360, 22961, 7743, '<td valign="top">There needs to be more contrast between the bitds and the trees to make them stand out better.  I think better focus would help here.  A graduated ND filter with the dark portion over the foreground and the use of spot metering on the birds might help here as well.  The foreground has too much glare and therefore detracts from your main subjects.</td>', 'There needs to be more contrast between the bitds and the trees to make them stand out better.  I think better focus would help here.  A graduated ND filter with the dark portion over the foreground and the use of spot metering on the birds might help here as well.  The foreground has too much glare and therefore detracts from your main subjects.', '2003-06-03 21:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(314361, 22999, 7743, '<td valign="top">The reflection is nice but the glare from the sky is distracting.</td>', 'The reflection is nice but the glare from the sky is distracting.', '2003-06-03 21:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(314363, 22846, 7743, '<td valign="top">A pass through Neat Image may have helped with the noise in this image.</td>', 'A pass through Neat Image may have helped with the noise in this image.', '2003-06-03 21:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(314365, 23072, 4871, '<td valign="top">I suppose you could say that this WAS home sweet home! A beautiful shot - I am one who loves sepia tone... however I don''t know whether it was necessary in this shot, but that''s just me personally.</td>', 'I suppose you could say that this WAS home sweet home! A beautiful shot - I am one who loves sepia tone... however I don''t know whether it was necessary in this shot, but that''s just me personally.', '2003-06-03 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(314366, 22406, 4871, '<td valign="top">I would have rated it higher if I could see what was in the photo frame and the candles and the picture in the background were either more visible or not there. Great idea though!</td>', 'I would have rated it higher if I could see what was in the photo frame and the candles and the picture in the background were either more visible or not there. Great idea though!', '2003-06-03 21:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(314369, 23057, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed and exposed.  I like the arrangement of pictures.  I think it might be suffering from noise or moire or something.  You might try passing the picture through Neat Image to see if that helps.</td>', 'This is nicely composed and exposed.  I like the arrangement of pictures.  I think it might be suffering from noise or moire or something.  You might try passing the picture through Neat Image to see if that helps.', '2003-06-03 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(314370, 23063, 7743, '<td valign="top">Gee, this looks like the Ottawa River.  Nicely done.  I like how you captured the lighting of the Supreme Court building.    The only thing I might have tried (and you may have already) is to crop the heavily lit building on the left out.  I think the image would still be well balanced without it.</td>', 'Gee, this looks like the Ottawa River.  Nicely done.  I like how you captured the lighting of the Supreme Court building.    The only thing I might have tried (and you may have already) is to crop the heavily lit building on the left out.  I think the image would still be well balanced without it.', '2003-06-03 22:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(314371, 23039, 4871, '<td valign="top">I love the picture, but I think the lighting is a bit harsh. It blows out in quite a few places. If you had softened the light so the shadows were not so prominent, it would have had a softer, more comfortable look overall.</td>', 'I love the picture, but I think the lighting is a bit harsh. It blows out in quite a few places. If you had softened the light so the shadows were not so prominent, it would have had a softer, more comfortable look overall.', '2003-06-03 22:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(314372, 23074, 7743, '<td valign="top">A polarizer, ND or UV filter would probably have helped here.  There is a lot of haze in the background and it is very bright.  A graduated ND filter would help bring out the exposure of the foreground without blowing out the background.</td>', 'A polarizer, ND or UV filter would probably have helped here.  There is a lot of haze in the background and it is very bright.  A graduated ND filter would help bring out the exposure of the foreground without blowing out the background.', '2003-06-03 22:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(314373, 22836, 7743, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2003-06-03 22:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(314375, 22621, 7556, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2003-06-03 22:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(314376, 22704, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, though I would have exposed the mountains a little more.  The way it is it just looks like a jagged line across the horizon.</td>', 'Nice colour, though I would have exposed the mountains a little more.  The way it is it just looks like a jagged line across the horizon.', '2003-06-03 22:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
