(314393, 22634, 7743, '<td valign="top">These types of images tend to work better in lanscape (horizontal) rather than portrait (vertical).  Also, it is usually best to put the horizon either 1/3 from the top or bottom and not through the middle.  You were probably trying to emphasize the landscape as well as the sky.  Choose one and shoot to get that effect.  I think in this case more sky would be the best choice due to the interest in the clouds.</td>', 'These types of images tend to work better in lanscape (horizontal) rather than portrait (vertical).  Also, it is usually best to put the horizon either 1/3 from the top or bottom and not through the middle.  You were probably trying to emphasize the landscape as well as the sky.  Choose one and shoot to get that effect.  I think in this case more sky would be the best choice due to the interest in the clouds.', '2003-06-03 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
