(314487, 23048, 5892, '<td valign="top">lighting adds interest to an otherwise normal picture... I like the mood it creates. 7.</td>', 'lighting adds interest to an otherwise normal picture... I like the mood it creates. 7.', '2003-06-04 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
