(314492, 23031, 5892, '<td valign="top">good use of negative space. Green looks a little bit oversaturated ? It''s close though, I could be wrong.</td>', 'good use of negative space. Green looks a little bit oversaturated ? It''s close though, I could be wrong.', '2003-06-04 00:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(314493, 23013, 5892, '<td valign="top">the wide black border is very effective. A beeee-utiful shot!</td>', 'the wide black border is very effective. A beeee-utiful shot!', '2003-06-04 00:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(314495, 22497, 7778, '<td valign="top">Simple, original, very homey! Thanks for sparing us the sweetness!<br/>The composition is tasteful and fun, the background hue very appropiate. Love the worn, ornate oven plate (or whatever it may be).</td>', 'Simple, original, very homey! Thanks for sparing us the sweetness!The composition is tasteful and fun, the background hue very appropiate. Love the worn, ornate oven plate (or whatever it may be).', '2003-06-04 00:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(314496, 23056, 5892, '<td valign="top">the evening light makes for a nice soft romantic picture. I wish it was a bit better focused</td>', 'the evening light makes for a nice soft romantic picture. I wish it was a bit better focused', '2003-06-04 00:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(314497, 23041, 5892, '<td valign="top">I like the lines of light at the top of each stair. Usually I don''t go for cat/dog pictures, but I think that this one works. Good title. I also like that I can see the stairs turn to the right near the top...makes it more interesting.</td>', 'I like the lines of light at the top of each stair. Usually I don''t go for cat/dog pictures, but I think that this one works. Good title. I also like that I can see the stairs turn to the right near the top...makes it more interesting.', '2003-06-04 00:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(314498, 22634, 5892, '<td valign="top">Wow... this picture just has tons and tons of depth. You picked a perfect day!</td>', 'Wow... this picture just has tons and tons of depth. You picked a perfect day!', '2003-06-04 00:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(314499, 22935, 5892, '<td valign="top">Good stuff. I especially like you chose to include a hint of the expression in the mouth. The hood was a good choice as well.</td>', 'Good stuff. I especially like you chose to include a hint of the expression in the mouth. The hood was a good choice as well.', '2003-06-04 00:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(314500, 22996, 7778, '<td valign="top">Alas, if the white pickets were bamboo...  :-/<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Alas, if the white pickets were bamboo...  :-/  ', '2003-06-04 00:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(314501, 22987, 5892, '<td valign="top">Very artsy - I like it. To tell you the truth, the wine bottle is a bit distracting, although I''m sure there is a reason for it. Good job overall. Still wouldn''t mind a little bit more clarity of the picture.</td>', 'Very artsy - I like it. To tell you the truth, the wine bottle is a bit distracting, although I''m sure there is a reason for it. Good job overall. Still wouldn''t mind a little bit more clarity of the picture.', '2003-06-04 00:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(314502, 23059, 5892, '<td valign="top">It would be a much much better picture of it were clearer... did you consider getting the ant closer up? I think it would have been effective.</td>', 'It would be a much much better picture of it were clearer... did you consider getting the ant closer up? I think it would have been effective.', '2003-06-04 00:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(314503, 23012, 5892, '<td valign="top">I think that it would be more effective if it were right-side-up instead of up-side down.. just an opinion though. Neat shot.</td>', 'I think that it would be more effective if it were right-side-up instead of up-side down.. just an opinion though. Neat shot.', '2003-06-04 00:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(314504, 23052, 5892, '<td valign="top">Everything looks so cozy.....can I come and move in with you? Lol- good shot.</td>', 'Everything looks so cozy.....can I come and move in with you? Lol- good shot.', '2003-06-04 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(314505, 22982, 5892, '<td valign="top">look at his tongue! That''s fabulous! What a great shot. I can''t get over the expression on his face. 10.</td>', 'look at his tongue! That''s fabulous! What a great shot. I can''t get over the expression on his face. 10.', '2003-06-04 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
