(314507, 23066, 5892, '<td valign="top">Oh... I wish so much that you stood on the other side of the sign and shot the exact same picture...although I can see how the sign adds interest, that house and car on their own make a picture perfect suburban image. Great shot either way.</td>', 'Oh... I wish so much that you stood on the other side of the sign and shot the exact same picture...although I can see how the sign adds interest, that house and car on their own make a picture perfect suburban image. Great shot either way.', '2003-06-04 00:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
