(314516, 23041, 7778, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened (?), perhaps, but still a superb capture with the focused symmetry of the feline''s face dominating the picture. The intensity makes it more than a ''pet pic''. The title, really, was needed here to tie to challenge. Well done.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened (?), perhaps, but still a superb capture with the focused symmetry of the feline''s face dominating the picture. The intensity makes it more than a ''pet pic''. The title, really, was needed here to tie to challenge. Well done.', '2003-06-04 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(314521, 22946, 6870, '<td valign="top">This shoulda done better! I have no idea why anyone would give this a low score. It speaks of "home" better than most photographs of the challenge, it is in focus, and it is a creative use of color. I guess you never know...</td>', 'This shoulda done better! I have no idea why anyone would give this a low score. It speaks of "home" better than most photographs of the challenge, it is in focus, and it is a creative use of color. I guess you never know...', '2003-06-04 01:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
