(314630, 23000, 6696, '<td valign="top">I thought that border looked familiar. :)  As mentioned below, lighting and contrast of the curtain against the shadows falling just past the subjects knee creates an interesting mood.</td>', 'I thought that border looked familiar. :)  As mentioned below, lighting and contrast of the curtain against the shadows falling just past the subjects knee creates an interesting mood.', '2003-06-04 02:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(314683, 22428, 6172, '<td valign="top">Just a word of sympathy for your score on this one.  I hope it doesn''t get you down.  I hardly ever tell people what I vote on their pictures, but if it''s any help, I gave you an 8 on this.  After looking at some of the pic''s that scored higher I felt compelled to comment.  I don''t understand how you possibly scored this low on this photo.  It really has a lot of character.  I think you got a bad deal!  Keep up the good work, and don''t change because of low scores like this :)</td>', 'Just a word of sympathy for your score on this one.  I hope it doesn''t get you down.  I hardly ever tell people what I vote on their pictures, but if it''s any help, I gave you an 8 on this.  After looking at some of the pic''s that scored higher I felt compelled to comment.  I don''t understand how you possibly scored this low on this photo.  It really has a lot of character.  I think you got a bad deal!  Keep up the good work, and don''t change because of low scores like this :)', '2003-06-04 03:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(314685, 22857, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent ribbon shot!</td>', 'Excellent ribbon shot!', '2003-06-04 03:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(314728, 22907, 8414, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, I cropped out his face because I wanted to maintain his anonymity and because the photo is of his home, not the person.  Getting the word mobile in the background was pure luck, I was driving through downtown when I saw him and grabbed my camera to quickly take the picture, only when I checked it at home did I see my good fortune.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, I cropped out his face because I wanted to maintain his anonymity and because the photo is of his home, not the person.  Getting the word mobile in the background was pure luck, I was driving through downtown when I saw him and grabbed my camera to quickly take the picture, only when I checked it at home did I see my good fortune.', '2003-06-04 03:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(314756, 23006, 4411, '<td valign="top">For those who felt this didn''t meet the challenge - you are correct in the literal sense. Thank you to those who left comments saying so. Here''s a better explanation of my reasoning behind the shot:<br/> <br/>A house is not a home.<br/>I don''t feel I''ve found a place that I would call home in the emotional sense since I left my parent''s house 14 years ago. I tried to illustrate that with a shot of something that is forever moving, carrying it''s home on it''s back.<br/>I would have loved to have been able to lie flat out in the garden and use my house as a background to appease the literal voters, but the weather wasn''t playing ball.</td>', 'For those who felt this didn''t meet the challenge - you are correct in the literal sense. Thank you to those who left comments saying so. Here''s a better explanation of my reasoning behind the shot: A house is not a home.I don''t feel I''ve found a place that I would call home in the emotional sense since I left my parent''s house 14 years ago. I tried to illustrate that with a shot of something that is forever moving, carrying it''s home on it''s back.I would have loved to have been able to lie flat out in the garden and use my house as a background to appease the literal voters, but the weather wasn''t playing ball.', '2003-06-04 03:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(314792, 22989, 5585, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this didn''t do better... I see no Blatant.. "YOU SUCK" Flaws....lol</td>', 'I don''t know why this didn''t do better... I see no Blatant.. "YOU SUCK" Flaws....lol', '2003-06-04 05:13:14.000000', NULL, 0),
