(324132, 22848, 8938, '<td valign="top">Must express sincere appreciation to all who commented on it, particularly Karmat of the Critique Club for the time spent on sharing valuable viewpoints. Needless to say, I benefitted a great deal from all the opinions and hope to be able to improve upon my future picture taking - the new hobby.<br/> <br/>Again, thanks and best wishes to Karmat and 13 others whose names are herein.<br/> <br/>donpram</td>', 'Must express sincere appreciation to all who commented on it, particularly Karmat of the Critique Club for the time spent on sharing valuable viewpoints. Needless to say, I benefitted a great deal from all the opinions and hope to be able to improve upon my future picture taking - the new hobby. Again, thanks and best wishes to Karmat and 13 others whose names are herein. donpram', '2003-06-13 03:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
