(721373, 22489, 16004, '<td valign="top">I have lived here all my life, and you know what, i don''t think i ever saw the sky-line like this from this side of the river before - at least not docklands and the mill dome in the same view (i am SO used to seeing them the other side to each other that this view is entirely alien to me...)  i''ve been to ally pally once, but twas hazy so I missed out on this great view.  only guessing, but i think that must be shooters hill behind the dome (other side of which i used to live).  this is a terrific first submission - i love how rich the greens came out.</td>', 'I have lived here all my life, and you know what, i don''t think i ever saw the sky-line like this from this side of the river before - at least not docklands and the mill dome in the same view (i am SO used to seeing them the other side to each other that this view is entirely alien to me...)  i''ve been to ally pally once, but twas hazy so I missed out on this great view.  only guessing, but i think that must be shooters hill behind the dome (other side of which i used to live).  this is a terrific first submission - i love how rich the greens came out.', '2004-05-16 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
