(1192573, 22857, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am in awe at this photo.  It skates so close to the edge. It could easily have been a facile knockoff of a bad photo-album shot from the early fifties - notwithstanding the impactful placement of the camera, the subjects and two sheets.  But it is animated by the three people who enjoy each other''s good company.  Wow.</td>', 'I am in awe at this photo.  It skates so close to the edge. It could easily have been a facile knockoff of a bad photo-album shot from the early fifties - notwithstanding the impactful placement of the camera, the subjects and two sheets.  But it is animated by the three people who enjoy each other''s good company.  Wow.', '2005-02-24 11:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
