(2741153, 22857, 30959, '<td valign="top">I had not seen this one before. I remember well the days of playing in the yard around the clean sheets as they hung on the clothes line with either my mother or grandmother cautioning us not to pull them off the line as three mini-tornadoes made thier way in and out among the magnificent textures and smells. Thanks for the trip back.</td>', 'I had not seen this one before. I remember well the days of playing in the yard around the clean sheets as they hung on the clothes line with either my mother or grandmother cautioning us not to pull them off the line as three mini-tornadoes made thier way in and out among the magnificent textures and smells. Thanks for the trip back.', '2006-08-19 04:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
